[1191]={o="Let's go!"},
[1192]={o="I'd like to integrate indurium into different parts of our racers, but I need large amounts of raw indurium to create these parts. You can find indurium ore in the Uldaman excavation in the Badlands, across the sea in Khaz Modan. The gnomes are getting their own supply of it, so it's important we get our own to keep pace with them.",r={"Indurium Ore (4)"}},
[1193]={o="A large, broken trap lies before you. &nbsp;From the looks of it, the ogres have tried to repair the trap but to no avail. &nbsp;A hastily written note lies next to the trap, and strangely enough it details exactly what is needed to repair it: a thorium widget and some frost oil. &nbsp;Were the trap repaired, an ogre passing near it might get trapped, and could be avoided. Clearly, it would seem fortuitous that very few ogres know how to read. Clearly.",r={"Thorium Widget (1)","Frost Oil (1)"}},
[1194]={o="Bring the Sample of Indurium Ore to Pozzik on the Shimmering Flats."},
