[3385]={o="Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Retrieve the Trader's Satchel from his corpse and return it to Nilith.",r={"Trade Master Kovic (1)","Clunk (1)","Trader's Satchel (1)"}},
[3402]={o="Speak with Vizzklick in Gadgetzan."},
[3421]={o="I will return you to Sanath's camp now. Do not mind his bad manners--he is rude to everyone save for the master. Perhaps he shall learn his lesson one day."},
[3441]={o="Listen as Kalaran Windblade tells his story.",r={"Kalaran Story (1)"}},
[3442]={o="Collect 4 Hearts of Flame and 4 globes of Golem Oil and return the items to Kalaran Windblade.",r={"Heart of Flame (4)","Golem Oil (4)"}},
[3443]={o="Bring 8 Thorium Plated Daggers to Kalaran Windblade.",r={"Thorium Plated Dagger (8)"}},
[3444]={o="Retrieve the Stone Circle from Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet.",r={"Stone Circle (1)"}},
[3445]={o="Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris."},
[3446]={o="Find the Altar of Hakkar in the Sunken Temple in Swamp of Sorrows."},
[3447]={o="Travel into the Sunken Temple and discover the secret hidden in the circle of statues."},
[3448]={o="Speak to Tymor in Ironforge."},
[3449]={o="Using the Drawing Kit, make rubbings of the Rune of Beth'Amara, the Rune of Jin'yael, the Rune of Markri, and the Rune of Sael'hai before heading to the small island off of the southern peninsula of Azshara and signaling Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter to pick them up.",r={"Rubbing: Rune of Beth'Amara (1)","Rubbing: Rune of Jin'yael (1)","Rubbing: Rune of Markri (1)","Rubbing: Rune of Sael'hai (1)"}},
[3450]={o="Speak to Xiggs Fuselighter in Ironforge."},
[3451]={o="Speak to Xiggs Fuselighter and get a Standard Issue Flare Gun from him in Ironforge."},
[3452]={o="Find and return a Symbol of Ragnaros to Kalaran Windblade.",r={"Symbol of Ragnaros (1)"}},
[3453]={o="Wait for Kalaran Windblade to complete the Torch of Retribution.",r={"Torch Creation (1)"}},
[3454]={o="Take the Torch of Retribution."},
[3461]={o="Return Tymor's Drawing Kit to him in Ironforge."},
[3462]={o="Speak with Squire Maltrake."},
[3463]={o="Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings.",r={"Western Tower Ablaze (1)","Southern Tower Ablaze (1)","Eastern Tower Ablaze (1)","Northern Tower Ablaze (1)"}},
[3481]={o="Open the chest."},
[3483]={o="Ah, another flare gun, huh? That I can do. And don't forget, southern tip of Azshara. It's a small little island that's been turned into a landing pad. You can't miss it if you're in the right spot."},
[3501]={o="Bring Kum'isha Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments and be rewarded for each one you turn in.",r={"Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment (1)"}},
[3502]={o="Bring Kum'isha Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments. Any form of monster in the Blasted Lands could be carrying a fragment.",r={"Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment (1)"}},
[3503]={o="There was a time when I could ask whatever I wished from those who sought out my master. &nbsp;But now, you need only ask and I will send you to him. It is upsetting to me, but I do not question his orders. &nbsp;I can only take enjoyment in making fun of the ridiculous clothes you wear or the pathetic look on your face. &nbsp;Even that bores me... Even this rambling bores me! &nbsp;Do you wish to see my master or not?"},
[3504]={o="Deliver the Sealed Letter to Ag'tor to Ag'tor Bloodfist in Azshara."},
[3505]={o="Kill 10 Blood Elf Reclaimers, and 10 Blood Elf Surveyors before seeking out Magus Rimtori's camp. Once you've found it, look for something that might be important to her that can be used to draw her into a fight.",r={"Blood Elf Reclaimer (10)","Blood Elf Surveyor (10)","(1)","Find Magus Rimtori's camp (1)"}},
[3506]={o="Destroy the arcane focusing crystal tied to Magus Rimtori and then slay her. Afterwards, take the Head of Magus Rimtori to Ag'tor Bloodfist in Azshara.",r={"Head of Magus Rimtori (1)"}},
[3507]={o="Speak to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar."},
[3508]={o="Wait for Loramus to complete the enlightenment spell."},
[3509]={o="Speak with Lord Arkkoroc in Azshara. Begin your search at the waters edge to find the Temple of Arkkoran."},
[3510]={o="Slay Hetaera and bring back Hetaera's Bloodied Head, Hetaera's Beaten Head, and Hetaera's Bruised Head to Lord Arkkoroc.",r={"Hetaera's Beaten Head (1)","Hetaera's Bloodied Head (1)","Hetaera's Bruised Head (1)"}},
[3511]={o="Take the temper back to Loramus Thalipedes."},
[3512]={o="Travel to the eastern part of Winterspring and speak with Umbranse the Spiritspeaker."},
[3513]={o="Take the Runed Scroll to the northern guard tower in the Barrens."},
[3514]={o="Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster.",r={"Rynthariel the Keymaster (1)"}},
[3517]={o="Find the Tablet of Beth'Amara, the Tablet of Jin'yael, the Tablet of Markri, and the Tablet of Sael'hai before returning to Jediga in Azshara.",r={"Tablet of Beth'Amara (1)","Tablet of Jin'yael (1)","Tablet of Markri (1)","Tablet of Sael'hai (1)"}},
[3518]={o="Bring the Tablet of Beth'Amara to Magatha in Thunder Bluff."},
[3519]={o="Speak to Dirania Silvershine in Shadowglen.",s="Iverron",e="Dirania Silvershine"},
[3520]={o="Capture the spirits of 3 screechers in Feralas, then return to Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port.",r={"Screecher Spirits Collected (3)"}},
[3521]={o="Collect 7 Hyacinth Mushrooms, 4 Moonpetal Lilies, and 1 Webwood Ichor for Dirania Silveshine in Shadowglen.",r={"Hyacinth Mushroom (7)","Moonpetal Lily (4)","Webwood Ichor (1)"},s="Dirania Silvershine",e="Dirania Silvershine"},
[3522]={o="Bring Iverron's Antidote to Iverron before the time limit is up. Iverron can be found by the cave to the north.",s="Dirania Silvershine",e="Iverron"},
[3523]={o="If you agree to aid Belnistrasz, speak with him again and hand the Oathstone he gave you back to him."},
[3524]={o="Recover Sea Creature Bones from the beached sea creature just south of Auberdine, and then return with it to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",r={"Sea Creature Bones (1)"},s="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde",e="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde"},
[3525]={o="Escort Belnistrasz to the Quilboar's idol in Razorfen Downs. Protect Belnistrasz while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol.",r={"Protect Belnistrasz while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol (1)"}},
[3526]={o="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan."},
[3527]={o="Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",r={"First Mosh'aru Tablet (1)","Second Mosh'aru Tablet (1)"}},
[3528]={o="Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",r={"Filled Egg of Hakkar (1)","Essence of Hakkar (1)"}},
[3541]={o="Bring the Tablet of Jin'yael to Jes'rimon in Orgrimmar."},
[3542]={o="Bring the Tablet of Markri to Andron Gant in Undercity."},
[3561]={o="Bring the Tablet of Sael'hai to Archmage Xylem in Azshara."},
[3562]={o="Deliver Magatha's Note to Jediga in Azshara."},
[3563]={o="Deliver Jes'rimon's Note to Jediga in Azshara."},
[3564]={o="Deliver Andron's Note to Jediga in Azshara."},
[3565]={o="Deliver Xylem's Note to Jediga in Azshara."},
[3566]={o="Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion.",r={"Head of Lathoric the Black (1)","Heart of Obsidion (1)"}},
[3567]={o="Would you like to see the view atop one of the twin colossals? I can send you there, &lt;race&gt;. Do consider how you will get down, though. This is a one way trip only.",s="Marli Wishrunner",e="Marli Wishrunner"},
[3568]={o="Fill all 4 Empty Vials at the tide pools along the coast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara before returning to Chemist Cuely.",r={"Filled Vial Labeled #1 (1)","Filled Vial Labeled #2 (1)","Filled Vial Labeled #3 (1)","Filled Vial Labeled #4 (1)"}},
[3569]={o="Give Cuely's Elixir to Thersa Windsong in Undercity."},
[3570]={o="I never dreamed the elixir would take hold that quickly. Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. I will get to work on the rest of these samples right away. I'm sure they'll be usable by the Lady Sylvanas and the Forsaken soon enough."},
[3601]={o="Search the Thalassian Base Camp for Kim'jael's Compass, Scope, Stuffed Chicken and Wizzlegoober, then return them to him in Azshara.",r={"Kim'Jael's Compass (1)","Kim'Jael's Scope (1)","Kim'Jael's Stuffed Chicken (1)","Kim'Jael's Wizzlegoober (1)"}},
[3602]={o="Recover twenty Crystallized Azsharite from southern Azshara. You may use the Felhound to assist you in 'sniffing' out the location of cleverly hidden deposits. Return to Loramus when the task is complete.",r={"Crystallized Azsharite (20)","Crystallized Note (1)","Crystallized Note (1)"}},
[3621]={o="Take the Shipment to Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale."},
[3625]={o="Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry.",r={"Weaponry Creation (1)"}},
[3626]={o="Return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde."},
[3627]={o="Slay Grol the Destroyer, Lady Sevine, and Archmage Allistarj. From their corpses take the Amulet of Grol, the Amulet of Sevine, and the Amulet of Allistarj. Remember to USE your Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry to weaken the triad. They cannot be killed otherwise - but use them wisely...",r={"Amulet of Allistarj (1)","Amulet of Grol (1)","Amulet of Sevine (1)"}},
[3628]={o="Destroy Razelikh the Defiler and return the Severed Horn of the Defiler to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. You will also need to return the Ward of the Defiler so that the Fallen Hero can destroy it, preventing it from ever falling into the wrong hands.",r={"Severed Horn of the Defiler (1)"}},
[3629]={o="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan."},
[3630]={o="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge."},
[3631]={o="Speak to Strahad Farsan in the Barrens."},
[3632]={o="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge."},
[3633]={o="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan."},
[3634]={o="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge."},
[3635]={o="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay."},
[3636]={o="Archbishop Bendictus wants you to slay Amnennar the Coldbringer in Razorfen Downs.",r={"Amnennar the Coldbringer (1)"}},
[3637]={o="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay."},
[3638]={o="If you agree to become a Goblin Engineer, then right-click on the Pledge of Secrecy and speak once more with Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",r={"Nixx's Signed Pledge (1)"}},
[3639]={o="Bring 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 Solid Dynamite, and 5 Explosive Sheep to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",r={"Big Iron Bomb (20)","Solid Dynamite (20)","Explosive Sheep (5)"}},
[3640]={o="If you agree to become a Gnome Engineer, then right-click on the Pledge of Secrecy and speak once more with Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",r={"Overspark's Signed Pledge (1)"}},
[3641]={o="Bring 6 Mithril Tubes, an Accurate Scope, and 2 Advanced Target Dummies to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",r={"Mithril Tube (6)","Accurate Scope (1)","Advanced Target Dummy (2)"}},
[3642]={o="If you agree to become a Gnome Engineer, then right-click on the Pledge of Secrecy and speak once more with Oglethrope Obnoticus in Booty bay.",r={"Oglethorpe's Signed Pledge (1)"}},
[3643]={o="Bring 6 Mithril Tubes, an Accurate Scope, and a 2 Advanced Target Dummies to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.",r={"Mithril Tube (6)","Accurate Scope (1)","Advanced Target Dummy (2)"}},
[3644]={o="In order to renew your membership card, you will need to pay the renewal fee of two gold pieces.",r={"Money: 2 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[3645]={o="In order to renew your membership card, you will need to pay the renewal fee of two gold pieces.",r={"Money: 2 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[3646]={o="In order to renew your membership card, you will need to pay the renewal fee of two gold pieces.",r={"Money: 2 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[3647]={o="In order to renew your membership card, you will need to pay the renewal fee of two gold pieces.",r={"Money: 2 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[3661]={o="Collect 15 Wildkin Feathers from the Hinterlands for Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.",r={"Wildkin Feather (15)"}},
[3681]={o="Speak with Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",s="Brandur Ironhammer",e="Duthorian Rall"},
[3701]={o="Venture to the Ruins of Thaurissan in the Burning Steppes and recover information from the Thaurissan Relics. Return to Royal Historian Archesonus when you have recovered the information.",r={"Information Recovered (12)"}},
[3702]={o="Listen to Royal Historian Archesonus recant the history of Thaurissan.",r={"Story of Thaurissan (1)"}},
[3721]={o="You've recovered three of my OOX homing robots! &nbsp;You've gone above and beyond what you needed to, so I will give you something special for all your help. &nbsp;It is a miniature version of the very same robot that you have come to know and love, the OOX! I normally wouldn't let anyone have such a potentially lethal device, but you've been a real help. &nbsp;Besides - the combat mechanisms and the homing logic on this one have been disabled. Other than that, it's an OOX by golly!"},
[3741]={o="Find Hilary's Necklace, and return it to Hilary in Lakeshire.",r={"Hilary's Necklace (1)"},s="Shawn",e="Hilary"},
[3761]={o="Bring 20 Un'Goro Soil samples to Ghede on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",r={"Un'Goro Soil (20)"}},
[3762]={o="Speak with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff."},
[3763]={o="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."},
[3764]={o="Bring 20 Un'Goro Soil samples to Jenal at the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus.",r={"Un'Goro Soil (20)"}},
[3765]={o="Travel to Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine.",s="Argos Nightwhisper",e="Gershala Nightwhisper"},
[3781]={o="Take the Arch Druid's Seed Voucher to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus."},
[3782]={o="Take the Seed Voucher to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff."},
[3783]={o="Collect 10 Thick Yeti Furs for Umi Rumplesnicker in Everlook.",r={"Thick Yeti Fur (10)"}},
[3784]={o="Speak with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff."},
[3785]={o="Use an Evergreen Pouch with a Packet of Tharlendis Seeds and two Un'Goro Soil samples to try and cultivate samples of Morrowgrain. Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus.",r={"Morrowgrain (10)"}},
[3786]={o="Use an Evergreen Pouch with a Packet of Tharlendis Seeds and two Un'Goro Soil samples to try and cultivate samples of Morrowgrain. Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",r={"Morrowgrain (10)"}},
[3787]={o="Speak with Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold."},
[3788]={o="Speak with Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold."},
[3789]={o="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."},
[3790]={o="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."},
[3791]={o="Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",r={"Morrowgrain (10)"}},
[3792]={o="Hello again, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;My research is progressing fairly well, but if you have five more Morrowgrain I'd be happy to take them off your hands. &nbsp;Well... happy is a figurative term in this case; the more I am around them, the more uncomfortable I feel. &nbsp;Still, my research demands I buckle down and get through this.",r={"Morrowgrain (5)"}},
[3801]={o="Speak with Franclorn Forgewright if you are interested in obtaining a key to the city major."},
[3802]={o="Slay Fineous Darkvire and recover the great hammer, Ironfel. Take Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place it on the statue of Franclorn Forgewright.",r={"Ironfel (1)"}},
[3803]={o="The Arch Druid is always looking for additional morrowgrain for the Cenarion Circle's continued research. &nbsp;We take them in increments of ten, and award you with a cache of goods you should find useful. &nbsp;When you have ten, let me know and I will reward you accordingly.",r={"Morrowgrain (10)"}},
[3804]={o="The Arch Druid is always looking for more morrowgrain for the Cenarion Circle's research project on Un'Goro Crater. &nbsp;We take them in increments of ten, and award you with a cache of goods you should find useful. &nbsp;When you have ten, let me know and I will award you accordingly.",r={"Morrowgrain (10)"}},
[3821]={o="Venture forth to the Burning Steppes and find out what became of Sha'ni Proudtusk."},
[3822]={o="Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock.",r={"Sha'ni's Nose-Ring (1)"}},
[3823]={o="Slay 15 Firegut Ogre-Mages, 7 Firegut Ogres, and 7 Firegut Ogre Brutes, and return to Oralius when you are finished.",r={"Firegut Ogre Mage (15)","Firegut Ogre (7)","Firegut Brute (7)"}},
[3824]={o="Find Gor'tesh, somewhere to the west of Dreadmaul Rock. Kill Gor'tesh and then take Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head back to Oralius in Burning Steppes.",r={"Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head (1)"}},
[3825]={o="Take Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head and place it at the top of Dreadmaul Rock. Look for a soft dirt mound to plant the pike.",r={"Gor'tesh Head Planted (1)"}},
[3841]={o="Speak to Quentin in Thousand Needles."},
[3842]={o="Bring 2 Elixir of Fortitudes to Quentin in Thousand Needles.",r={"Elixir of Lesser Fortitude (2)"}},
[3843]={o="Take your Fragile Sprite Darter Egg to the Hinterlands and speak to Agnar Beastamer, but hurry, you only have 1 hour to find him before the hatchling within the egg dies."},
[3844]={o="Look around in the pond for a clue about who this wrecked raft may belong to."},
[3845]={o="Examine the items inside the pack and bring them to their owner.",r={"Large Compass (1)","Curled Map Parchment (1)","Lion-headed Key (1)"}},
[3861]={o="Find some Special Chicken Feed and return to your befriended chicken. When you find it, /cheer at it before trying to give it the Special Chicken Feed.",r={"Special Chicken Feed (1)"},s="Chicken",e="Chicken"},
[3881]={o="Bring a Crate of Foodstuffs and Research Equipment to Williden Marshal in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Crate of Foodstuffs (1)","Research Equipment (1)"}},
[3882]={o="Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Dinosaur Bone (8)"}},
[3883]={o="Use the Scraping Vial to collect a Hive Wall Sample from one of the Gorishi hive hatcheries in Un'Goro Crater. &nbsp;Look for the chambers with the hanging larval spawns. Bring the Hive Wall Sample to Hol'anyee Marshal in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Hive Wall Sample (1)"}},
[3884]={o="Return the journal to Williden Marshal somewhere in Un'Goro Crater."},
[3901]={o="Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done.",r={"Rattlecage Skeleton (12)"}},
[3902]={o="Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain.",r={"Scavenged Goods (6)"}},
[3903]={o="Speak with Milly Osworth.",s="Deputy Willem",e="Milly Osworth"},
[3904]={o="Bring 8 crates of Milly's Harvest to Milly Osworth at Northshire Abbey.",r={"Milly's Harvest (8)"},s="Milly Osworth",e="Milly Osworth"},
[3905]={o="Bring the Grape Manifest to Brother Neals in Northshire Abbey.",s="Milly Osworth",e="Brother Neals"},
[3906]={o="Travel to the quarry in Blackrock Mountain and slay Overmaster Pyron. Return to Thunderheart when you have completed this assignment.",r={"Overmaster Pyron (1)"}},
[3907]={o="Enter Blackrock Depths and track down Lord Incendius. Slay him and return any source of information you may find to Thunderheart.",r={"Lord Incendius (1)","Tablet of Kurniya (1)"}},
[3908]={o="Take Linken's Sword to Donova Snowden in Winterspring."},
[3909]={o="Seek out Gregan Brewspewer in northern Feralas. From him, learn how you may acquire the Videre Elixir, then return to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",r={"Videre Elixir (1)","Evoroot (1)"}},
[3911]={o="Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.",r={"Essence of the Elements (10)"}},
[3912]={o="Go to the graveyard outside Gadgetzan, and use the Videre Elixir. Follow the rest of Donova's instructions to find Gaeriyan."},
[3913]={o="Resurrect, then look for the gravestone that Gaeriyan told you to find."},
[3914]={o="Deliver Linken's Superior Sword to Linken in Un'Goro Crater."},
[3921]={o="Bring the Broken Samophlange to Wenikee Boltbucket."},
[3922]={o="Bring 15 Nugget Slugs to Wenikee Boltbucket in the Barrens.",r={"Nugget Slug (15)"}},
[3923]={o="Bring the Broken and Battered Samophlange to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar."},
[3924]={o="Bring the Samophlange Manual to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar.",r={"Samophlange Manual (1)","Samophlange Manual Cover (1)","Samophlange Manual Page (5)"}},
[3941]={o="Find J.D. Collie in the cave at Marshal's Refuge."},
[3942]={o="Find Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood."},
[3961]={o="Take the Silver Totem of Aquementas to Linken in Marshal's Refuge."},
[3962]={o="Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge. Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",r={"Blazerunner (1)","Golden Flame (1)"}},
[3981]={o="Find Commander Gor'shak in Blackrock Depths. You recall that the crudely drawn picture of the orc included bars drawn over the portrait. Perhaps you should search for a prison of some sort."},
[3982]={o="Defend Gor'shak.",r={"Survive the Onslaught (1)"}},
[4001]={o="Speak with Kharan Mighthammer and gather information about Princess Moira Bronzebeard's kidnapping. Take that information to Thrall in Orgrimmar. You recall Gor'shak mentioning that Kharan is being held in a cell nearby.",r={"Information Gathered from Kharan (1)"}},
[4002]={o="Speak with Thrall if you are prepared to take on the mission he has planned."},
[4003]={o="Slay Emperor Dagran Thaurissan and free Princess Moira Bronzebeard from his evil spell.",r={"Emperor Dagran Thaurissan (1)"}},
[4004]={o="Return to Thrall!"},
[4005]={o="Take the Book of Aquor, the Silvery Claws, and the Irontree Heart to Tanaris. Use the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas. After you have the completed totem, take it to J.D. Collie in Marshal's Refuge.",r={"Silver Totem of Aquementas (1)","Silvery Claws (11)","Irontree Heart (1)","Book of Aquor (1)"}},
[4021]={o="Bring a Piece of Krom'zar's Banner to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",r={"Piece of Krom'zar's Banner (1)"}},
[4022]={o="Show Cyrus Therepentous the Black Dragonflight Molt you received from Kalaran Windblade.",r={"Black Dragonflight Molt (1)","Proof Presented (1)"}},
[4023]={o="Show Cyrus Therepentous proof of your worth. You have a feeling that Cyrus already knows that you are unworthy.",r={"Black Dragonflight Molt (1)"}},
[4024]={o="Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay Bael'Gar. You only know that the giant resides inside Blackrock Depths. Remember to use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on Bael'Gar's remains to capture the Fiery Essence. Return the Encased Fiery Essence to Cyrus Therepentous.",r={"Encased Fiery Essence (1)"}},
[4041]={o="Bring me an Evoroot, and sure, I can make ya that Videre Elixir. I know all kinds of things about herbs and alchemy... Why, let me tell you the story about the time I transmuted gold from the cheese I was going to eat for lunch... hey... Where are you going?",r={"Evoroot (1)"}},
[4061]={o="Venture to the Burning Steppes and recover 10 Fractured Elemental Shards for Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania. You recall Theodora mentioning the golems and elementals of that region as being a source for these shards.",r={"Fractured Elemental Shard (10)"}},
[4062]={o="Take the Elemental Shard Sample to Lotwil Veriatus. You recall Theodora saying that Lotwil was stationed in a camp to the east."},
[4063]={o="Find and slay Golem Lord Argelmach. Return his head to Lotwil. You will also need to collect 10 Intact Elemental Cores from the Ragereaver Golems and Warbringer Constructs protecting Argelmach. You know this because you are psychic.",r={"Head of Argelmach (1)","Intact Elemental Core (10)"}},
[4081]={o="Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors! Warlord Goretooth wants you to kill 15 Anvilrage Guardsmen, 10 Anvilrage Wardens and 5 Anvilrage Footmen. Return to him once your task is complete.",r={"Anvilrage Guardsman (15)","Anvilrage Warden (10)","Anvilrage Footman (5)"}},
[4082]={o="Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors! Warlord Goretooth wants you to kill 10 Anvilrage Medics, 10 Anvilrage Soldiers and 10 Anvilrage Officers. Return to him once your task is complete.",r={"Anvilrage Medic (10)","Anvilrage Soldier (10)","Anvilrage Officer (10)"}},
[4083]={o="The spectral chalice floats in the air, slowing rising and falling... as if to the beat of a dying heart.",r={"Star Ruby (2)","Gold Bar (20)","Truesilver Bar (10)"}},
[4084]={o="Collect 11 Silvery Claws and 1 Irontree Heart for Eridan Bluewind in Felwood.",r={"Silvery Claws (11)","Irontree Heart (1)"}},
[4101]={o="Bring 15 Blood Amber to Arathandris Silversky in Felwood.",r={"Blood Amber (15)"}},
[4102]={o="Bring 15 Blood Amber to Maybess Riverbreeze in Felwood.",r={"Blood Amber (15)"}},
[4103]={o="Possessing a Cenarion beacon allows one to see a corrupted soul shard on those tainted beasts that are put down for the greater good. &nbsp;I grind shards into a usable reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;We will use that salve to turn corrupted plants into healthy ones again. In exchange for these shards, I will give you some Cenarion plant salves I have already prepared.",r={"Corrupted Soul Shard (6)"}},
[4104]={o="If you possess a Cenarion beacon while mining in Felwood, you will be able to see tainted vitriol that corrupts a vein of raw metal. &nbsp;I know how to purify that vitriol and turn it into a reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;You will then use that salve on plants you find in the wild that need saving. If you have collected any tainted vitriol, I'll give you some Cenarion plant salve I have already prepared.",r={"Tainted Vitriol (4)"}},
[4105]={o="A Cenarion beacon allows a seasoned herbalist to spot insidious fel creep - a malfeasant product of Felwood's corruption. &nbsp;My work here has taught me the knowledge of purifying fel creep into a cleansing reagent... used in what we now refer to as Cenarion plant salve. When you gather herbs in Felwood, you should encounter the fel creep so long as you have the beacon. &nbsp;In exchange for what you bring to me, I will give you pre-made Cenarion plant salve.",r={"Fel Creep (4)"}},
[4106]={o="A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood. &nbsp;I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;When you skin your kills here in Felwood, be sure to have a beacon on you! When you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made.",r={"Patch of Tainted Skin (5)"}},
[4107]={o="The power of a disenchanted magical item is felt by the essence it creates. &nbsp;I've devised a way to turn raw essence used by enchanters into a suitable reagent for creating Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;You don't need a Cenarion beacon for this; any suitably disenchanted item that yields lesser nether essences will work. I just need a single lesser nether essence; in exchange, I will give you Cenarion plant salves. &nbsp;The essence is extremely potent - a little definitely goes a long way!",r={"Lesser Nether Essence (1)"}},
[4108]={o="Possessing a Cenarion beacon allows one to see a corrupted soul shard on those tainted beasts that are put down for the greater good. &nbsp;I grind shards into a usable reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;We will use that salve to turn corrupted plants into healthy ones again. In exchange for these shards, I will give you some Cenarion plant salves I have already prepared.",r={"Corrupted Soul Shard (6)"}},
[4109]={o="If you possess a Cenarion beacon while mining in Felwood, you will be able to see tainted vitriol that corrupts a vein of raw metal. &nbsp;I know how to purify that vitriol and turn it into a reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;You will then use that salve on plants you find in the wild that need saving. If you have collected any tainted vitriol, I'll give you some Cenarion plant salve I have already prepared.",r={"Tainted Vitriol (4)"}},
[4110]={o="A Cenarion beacon allows a seasoned herbalist to spot insidious fel creep - a malfeasant product of Felwood's corruption. &nbsp;My work here has taught me the knowledge of purifying fel creep into a cleansing reagent... used in what we now refer to as Cenarion plant salve. When you gather herbs in Felwood, you should encounter the fel creep so long as you have the beacon. &nbsp;In exchange for what you bring to me, I will give you pre-made Cenarion plant salve.",r={"Fel Creep (4)"}},
[4111]={o="A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood. &nbsp;I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;When you skin your kills here in Felwood, be sure to have a beacon on you! When you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made.",r={"Patch of Tainted Skin (5)"}},
[4112]={o="The power of a disenchanted magical item is felt by the essence it creates. &nbsp;I've devised a way to turn raw essence used by enchanters into a suitable reagent for creating Cenarion plant salve. &nbsp;You don't need a Cenarion beacon for this; any suitably disenchanted item that yields lesser nether essences will work. I just need a single lesser nether essence; in exchange, I will give you Cenarion plant salves. &nbsp;The essence is extremely potent - a little definitely goes a long way!",r={"Lesser Nether Essence (1)"}},
[4113]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. &nbsp;A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4114]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. &nbsp;A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4115]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. &nbsp;The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4116]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. &nbsp;A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4117]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a whipper root plant. &nbsp;The visible roots of the plant appear tough and leathery, and a slimy film hangs from the plant. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (3)"}},
[4118]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. &nbsp;A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4119]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a night dragon plant. &nbsp;The fruits that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (4)"}},
[4120]={o="Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas wants you to kill 12 Angerclaw Grizzlies and 12 Felpaw Ravagers in Felwood.",r={"Angerclaw Grizzly (12)","Felpaw Ravager (12)"}},
[4121]={o="Escort your prisoner, Grark Lorkrub, through Burning Steppes and through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge. You recall Lexlort mentioning that he would have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody. You will also be required to hand over your Thorium Shackles to Lexlort.",r={"Thorium Shackles (1)","Prisoner Transport (1)"}},
[4122]={o="Travel to the Burning Steppes and find Grark Lorkrub. You recall Lexlort mentioning that he was last seen in a massive Blackrock fortress. When you find Grark Lorkrub, use the Thorium Shackles to bind him and then lead him back through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge. Lexlort will have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody."},
[4123]={o="Bring the Heart of the Mountain to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes.",r={"The Heart of the Mountain (1)"}},
[4124]={o="Speak with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold."},
[4125]={o="Locate the courier's boat somewhere along the coast of Feralas."},
[4126]={o="Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos.",r={"Lost Thunderbrew Recipe (1)"}},
[4127]={o="Return to Feathermoon Stronghold and show Ginro Hearthkindle the Discarded Knife you have found."},
[4128]={o="Speak with Ragnar Thunderbrew."},
[4129]={o="Take the Discarded Knife to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold."},
[4130]={o="Speak with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold."},
[4131]={o="Search the Woodpaw Gnoll camps of southern Feralas for evidence of the courier's belongings or the courier himself."},
[4132]={o="Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay General Angerforge! Return to Warlord Goretooth when the task is complete.",r={"General Angerforge (1)"}},
[4133]={o="Speak with Shadowmaster Vivian Lagrave in Kargath."},
[4134]={o="Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",r={"Lost Thunderbrew Recipe (1)"}},
[4135]={o="Now that Raschal's last known whereabouts have been discovered, continue your search for him or his remains in the Writhing Deep. &nbsp;According to the note, it is located to the south of the Woodpaw gnoll camps."},
[4136]={o="Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Ribbly's Head (1)"}},
[4141]={o="Collect 15 Bloodpetals and return to Muigin.",r={"Bloodpetal (15)"}},
[4142]={o="Take a Bloodpetal to Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas."},
[4143]={o="Collect 5 samples of Atal'ai Haze, then return to Muigin in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Atal'ai Haze (5)"}},
[4144]={o="Here's the plan, &lt;name&gt;: Go out and collect some bloodpetal sprouts -- you know, the plants that haven't fully sprouted yet, and bring them here. Then I'll see what the Atal'ai haze can do. You may think I'm vengeful... Actually, you'd be right about that! Truth is, I know the way out of here, but until Larion will admit that I'm right, I'm staying right here! So off with you, find those bloodpetal sprouts and let's have some fun!",r={"Bloodpetal Sprout (3)"}},
[4145]={o="Hunt 5 Bloodpetal Lashers, 5 Bloodpetal Threshers, 5 Bloodpetal Flayers and 5 Bloodpetal Trappers for Larion at Marshal's Refuge.",r={"Bloodpetal Lasher (5)","Bloodpetal Trapper (5)","Bloodpetal Flayer (5)","Bloodpetal Thresher (5)"}},
[4146]={o="Deliver the Unloaded Zapper and 5 samples of Atal'ai Haze to Larion in Marshal's Refuge.",r={"Atal'ai Haze (5)"}},
[4147]={o="Travel to Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet."},
[4148]={o="For the zapper to work, it needs a sample of the target creature. Head out into the crater and collect a Bloodpetal sprout. Then I can calibrate it to work on Muigin's little friends... If he weren't so stubborn, we could be on our way home, already... But until then, I'll just have to show him that his little prank doesn't bother me at all!",r={"Bloodpetal Sprout (1)"}},
[4161]={o="Collect 7 Small Spider Legs for Zarrin in Dolanaar.",r={"Small Spider Leg (7)"},s="Zarrin",e="Zarrin"},
[4181]={o="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan."},
[4182]={o="Slay 15 Black Broodlings, 10 Black Dragonspawn, 4 Black Wyrmkin and 1 Black Drake. Return to Helendis Riverhorn when the task is complete.",r={"Black Broodling (15)","Black Dragonspawn (10)","Black Drake (1)","Black Wyrmkin (4)"}},
[4183]={o="Travel to Lakeshire and deliver Helendis Riverhorn's Letter to Magistrate Solomon."},
[4184]={o="Travel to Stormwind and deliver Solomon's Plea to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon. Bolvar resides in Stormwind Keep."},
[4185]={o="Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon after speaking with Lady Katrana Prestor.",r={"Advice from Lady Prestor (1)"}},
[4186]={o="Take Bolvar's Decree to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire."},
[4201]={o="Bring 4 Gromsblood, 10 Giant Silver Veins and Nagmara's Filled Vial to Mistress Nagmara in Blackrock Depths.",r={"Gromsblood (4)","Giant Silver Vein (10)","Nagmara's Filled Vial (1)"}},
[4221]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. &nbsp;The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4222]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. &nbsp;The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4223]={o="Speak with Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes."},
[4224]={o="Speak with Ragged John to learn of Marshal Windsor's fate and return to Marshal Maxwell when you have completed this task. You recall Marshal Maxwell telling you to search for him in a cave to the north.",r={"Ragged John's Story (1)"}},
[4241]={o="Travel to Blackrock Mountain in the northwest and enter Blackrock Depths. Find out what became of Marshal Windsor. You recall Ragged John talking about Windsor being dragged off to a prison."},
[4242]={o="Give Marshal Maxwell the bad news."},
[4243]={o="Find A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater."},
[4244]={o="Find a Mithril Casing and return to A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Mithril Casing (1)"}},
[4245]={o="Escort A-Me 01 back to Karna Remtravel in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Protect A-Me 01 until you reach Karna Remtravel (1)"}},
[4261]={o="Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale.",r={"Help Arei get to Safety (1)"}},
[4262]={o="Slay Overmaster Pyron and return to Jalinda Sprig. You recall Jalinda talking about Pyron guarding the quarry. Perhaps you should search there?",r={"Overmaster Pyron (1)"}},
[4263]={o="Find Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths and destroy him!",r={"Lord Incendius (1)"}},
[4264]={o="You may have just stumbled on to something that Marshal Windsor would be interested in seeing. There may be hope, after all."},
[4265]={o="Free Raschal from the Zukk'ash hive. Return to Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold and let him know that Raschal is alive and well.",r={"Free Raschal. (1)"}},
[4266]={o="Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold."},
[4267]={o="Bring Raschal's Report to Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus."},
[4281]={o="Bring the Undelivered Parcel to Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar."},
[4282]={o="Return Marshal Windsor's Lost Information. Marshal Windsor believes that the information is being held by Golem Lord Argelmach and General Angerforge.",r={"Marshal Windsor's Lost Information (1)","Marshal Windsor's Lost Information (1)"}},
[4283]={o="Oralius wants 50 Blackrock Medallions. Chances are high that these medallions can be found on the orcs in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Blackrock Medallion (50)"}},
[4284]={o="Collect 7 Power Crystals of each color: red, blue, yellow, and green. Bring them to J.D. Collie at Marshal's Refuge.",r={"Red Power Crystal (7)","Yellow Power Crystal (7)","Green Power Crystal (7)","Blue Power Crystal (7)"}},
[4285]={o="Discover the location of the Northern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Discover and examine the Northern Crystal Pylon (1)"}},
[4286]={o="Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs. Return to Oralius when you have completed this task. You assume that the Dark Iron dwarves inside Blackrock Depths carry these 'fanny pack' contraptions.",r={"Dark Iron Fanny Pack (20)"}},
[4287]={o="Discover the location of the Eastern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Discover and examine the Eastern Crystal Pylon (1)"}},
[4288]={o="Discover the location of the Western Crystal Pylon.",r={"Discover and examine the Western Crystal Pylon (1)"}},
[4289]={o="Bring 2 Un'Goro Gorilla Pelts, 2 Un'Goro Stomper Pelts, and 2 Un'Goro Thunderer Pelts to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Un'Goro Gorilla Pelt (2)","Un'Goro Stomper Pelt (2)","Un'Goro Thunderer Pelt (2)"}},
[4290]={o="Find the carcass of Lar'korwi's freshest kill and steal a Piece of Threshadon Carcass before returning to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Piece of Threshadon Carcass (1)"}},
[4291]={o="Bring 2 Ravasaur Pheromone Glands to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Ravasaur Pheromone Gland (2)"}},
[4292]={o="Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",r={"Lar'korwi's Head (1)"}},
[4293]={o="Gather Felwood Slime Samples from any of the slimes in Felwood. Then, using the Testing Equipment next to Chemist Fuely in Undercity, see which of your samples are the most corrupt. Bring 5 of the Corrupted Felwood Samples you find to Chemist Fuely.",r={"Corrupted Felwood Sample (5)","Felwood Slime Sample (100)"}},
[4294]={o="Gather Un'Goro Slime Samples from any of the slimes in Un'Goro Crater. Then, using the Testing Equipment next to Chemist Fuely in Undercity, see which of your samples are the most pure. Bring 5 of the Pure Un'Goro Samples you find to Chemist Fuely.",r={"Pure Un'Goro Sample (5)","Un'Goro Slime Sample (100)"}},
[4295]={o="Oh, ale! &nbsp;I would kill for some Dark Iron ale!! &nbsp;Quick, I'm getting sober! &nbsp;I know this because sobriety blurs my vision... and it's making you look like the &lt;race&gt; I slew last week!",r={"Dark Iron Ale Mug (2)"},s="Private Rocknot",e="Private Rocknot"},
[4296]={o="Bring the Tablet Transcript to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Tablet Transcript (1)"}},
[4297]={o="Bring 5 Silvermane Stalker Flanks to Agnar Beastamer in Hinterlands.",r={"Silvermane Stalker Flank (5)"}},
[4298]={o="Speak to Agnar Beastamer in the Hinterlands."},
[4300]={o="Bring 8 White Ravasaur Claws to Jes'rimon in Orgrimmar.",r={"White Ravasaur Claw (8)"}},
[4301]={o="Bring U'cha's Pelt to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.",r={"U'cha's Pelt (1)"}},
[4321]={o="Speak with J.D. Collie in a moment."},
[4322]={o="Help Marshal Windsor get his gear back and free his friends. Return to Marshal Maxwell if you succeed.",r={"Jail Break! (1)"}},
[4324]={o="Speak with Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes."},
[4341]={o="Travel to Blackrock Depths and find Kharan Mighthammer. The King mentioned that Kharan was being held prisoner there - perhaps you should try looking for a prison."},
[4342]={o="Listen as Kharan Mighthammer tells his story.",r={"Kharan's Tale (1)"}},
[4343]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. &nbsp;The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4361]={o="Return to Ironforge and deliver the bad news to King Magni Bronzebeard."},
[4362]={o="Return to Blackrock Depths and rescue Princess Moira Bronzebeard from the evil clutches of Emperor Dagran Thaurissan.",r={"Emperor Dagran Thaurissan (1)"}},
[4363]={o="Return to Ironforge and speak with King Magni Bronzebeard."},
[4381]={o="The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with yellow power crystals. According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to heal yourself or your allies.",r={"Yellow Power Crystal (10)","Green Power Crystal (10)"}},
[4382]={o="The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with blue power crystals. According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to increase your spirit.",r={"Green Power Crystal (10)","Blue Power Crystal (10)"}},
[4383]={o="The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with red power crystals. According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to strengthen the protection you have against physical damage.",r={"Red Power Crystal (10)","Green Power Crystal (10)"}},
[4384]={o="The Pylon table allows you to combine red power crystals with blue power crystals. According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to weaken an enemy's defenses.",r={"Red Power Crystal (10)","Blue Power Crystal (10)"}},
[4385]={o="The Pylon table allows you to combine red power crystals with yellow power crystals. According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to create a large explosion that can inflict damage on your enemies.",r={"Red Power Crystal (10)","Yellow Power Crystal (10)"}},
[4386]={o="The Pylon table allows you to combine blue power crystals with yellow power crystals. According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to create a shield that does damage to enemies.",r={"Blue Power Crystal (10)","Yellow Power Crystal (10)"}},
