[4466]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. &nbsp;The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4467]={o="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. &nbsp;The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. &nbsp;It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",r={"Cenarion Plant Salve (2)"}},
[4481]={o="There is a price to pay for all things in this world. The price for the specific item that you seek is thirty gold pieces. Naturally, I shall retain the majority of the components which you collected. But worry not, you shall have your trinket.",r={"Black Diamond (1)","Lung Juice Cocktail (1)","Libram of Constitution (1)","Night Dragon's Breath (4)","Money: 30 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[4482]={o="Thirty gold, &lt;race&gt;. Thirty gold and the required components.",r={"Black Diamond (1)","Libram of Tenacity (1)","Crystal Ward (4)","Eye of Kajal (1)","Money: 30 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[4483]={o="If it is resilience you desire, thirty gold I require.",r={"Black Diamond (1)","Crystal Spire (4)","Burning Essence (1)","Libram of Resilience (1)","Money: 30 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[4484]={o="Do not waste my time, &lt;race&gt;. Give me what I require. Thirty gold and the components.",r={"Black Diamond (1)","Libram of Voracity (1)","Whipper Root Tuber (4)","Crystal Force (4)","Money: 30 &nbsp; (1)"}},
[4485]={o="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind."},
[4486]={o="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind."},
[4487]={o="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."},
[4488]={o="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."},
[4489]={o="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."},
[4490]={o="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet to learn the ability to summon a Felsteed."},
[4491]={o="Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge. If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him.",r={"Escort Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge (1)"}},
[4492]={o="Find Ringo at Fire Plume Ridge."},
[4493]={o="Speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan."},
[4494]={o="Speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan."},
[4495]={o="Find Iverron by the cave to the north.",s="Dirania Silvershine",e="Iverron"},
[4496]={o="Bring a Gorishi Scent Gland and 5 Un'Goro Soil samples to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",r={"Gorishi Scent Gland (1)","Un'Goro Soil (5)"}},
[4501]={o="Kill 10 Pterrordax and 15 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.",r={"Pterrordax (10)","Frenzied Pterrordax (15)"}},
[4502]={o="Collect 9 samples of Un'Goro Ash from the fire elementals around the volcano in Un'Goro Crater, and return them to Liv Rizzlefix in Ratchet.",r={"Un'Goro Ash (9)"}},
[4503]={o="Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",r={"Webbed Diemetradon Scale (8)","Webbed Pterrordax Scale (8)"}},
[4504]={o="Collect 12 samples of Super Sticky Tar for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.",r={"Super Sticky Tar (12)"}},
[4505]={o="Collect a sample of corrupted water from the Jadefire Satyrs' moonwell and bring it to Winna Hazzard at Bloodvenom Post.",r={"Filled Flasket (1)"}},
[4506]={o="Take Winna's kitten to the corrupted moon well, release it, then bring it back to Winna. Once you have returned to Winna, click on the cat to release it to Winna.",r={"Return the corrupted cat to Winna Hazzard (1)"}},
[4507]={o="Defeat the Gorishi Hive Queen once she is summoned. Bring the Gorishi Queen's Brain to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",r={"Gorishi Queen Brain (1)"}},
[4508]={o="Bring Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus."},
[4509]={o="Bring Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar."},
[4510]={o="Bring the Bank Voucher to Idriana in the bank of Darnassus."},
[4511]={o="Bring the Bank Voucher to Karus in the bank of Orgrimmar."},
[4512]={o="Bring 6 Filled Cursed Ooze Jars and 6 Filled Tainted Ooze Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.",r={"Filled Cursed Ooze Jar (6)","Filled Tainted Ooze Jar (6)"}},
[4513]={o="Bring 10 Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge. If you have trouble finding them, perhaps try to get more clues from Laris.",r={"Filled Pure Sample Jar (10)"}},
[4521]={o="Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to kill 15 Raging Owlbeasts and 15 Ragged Owlbeasts.",r={"Raging Owlbeast (15)","Ragged Owlbeast (15)"}},
[4542]={o="Bring the Urgent Message to Cliffwatcher Longhorn at Freewind Post."},
[4561]={o="You take a sample of slime from Un'Goro Crater and place some of it into the various tubes and beakers on the table. As things begin to boil and spurt, the slime changes colors. When the process slows down and the liquids calm, you see a small petri dish with your purified Un'Goro slime samples in it along with some other remnants.",r={"Un'Goro Slime Sample (1)"}},
[4581]={o="Take Shindrell's Note to Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song.",s="Shindrell Swiftfire",e="Kayneth Stillwind"},
[4601]={o="Insert a Grime-Encrusted Item into the Sparklematic 5200, and be sure to have three silver coins to start the machine.",r={"Grime-Encrusted Object (1)","Required money: 3 (1)"},s="The Sparklematic 5200",e="The Sparklematic 5200"},
[4602]={o="Insert a Grime-Encrusted Item into the Sparklematic 5200, and be sure to have three silver coins to start the machine.",r={"Grime-Encrusted Object (1)","Required money: 3 (1)"},s="The Sparklematic 5200",e="The Sparklematic 5200"},
[4603]={o="The Sparklematic 5200 is empty, awaiting a grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to start!",r={"Grime-Encrusted Object (1)","Required money: 3 (1)"},s="The Sparklematic 5200",e="The Sparklematic 5200"},
[4604]={o="The Sparklematic 5200 is empty, awaiting a grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to start!",r={"Grime-Encrusted Object (1)","Required money: 3 (1)"},s="The Sparklematic 5200",e="The Sparklematic 5200"},
[4605]={o="As quickly as it started, the Sparklematic 5200 comes to an abrupt halt. &nbsp;A simple \"ding\" is heard from the machine, and the mouth of the machine spirals upward. &nbsp;Inside the Sparklematic 5200 is a small box wrapped in a little bow. &nbsp;The machine would appear to wrap an object up after eliminating its grime-encrusted status. &nbsp;Even if the machine didn't work, at least the item is now wrapped in a pretty box. Well, there is one way to find out if it cleaned the item or not...",s="The Sparklematic 5200",e="The Sparklematic 5200"},
[4606]={o="As quickly as it started, the Sparklematic 5200 comes to an abrupt halt. &nbsp;A simple \"ding\" is heard from the machine, and the mouth of the machine spirals upward. &nbsp;Inside the Sparklematic 5200 is a small box wrapped in a little bow. &nbsp;The machine would appear to wrap an object up after eliminating its grime-encrusted status. &nbsp;Even if the machine didn't work, at least the item is now wrapped in a pretty box. Well, there is one way to find out if it cleaned the item or not...",s="The Sparklematic 5200",e="The Sparklematic 5200"},
[4621]={o="Slay Fleet Master Seahorn and Baron Revilgaz of Booty Bay, and then return to Fleet Master Firallon aboard the Crimson Veil off the coast of Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Baron Revilgaz (1)","Fleet Master Seahorn (1)","Bloodsail Buccaneers: (1)"}},
[4641]={o="Speak with Gornek. You recall Kaltunk marking your map with his location and mentioning that Gornek resided in the Den, a building to the west."},
[4642]={o="Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",r={"Merged Ooze Sample (1)"}},
[4661]={o="You take a sample of slime from Felwood and place some of it into the various tubes and beakers on the table. As things begin to boil and spurt, the slime changes colors. When the process slows down and the liquids calm, you see a small petri dish with your altered Felwood slime samples in it along with some other remnants.",r={"Felwood Slime Sample (1)"}},
[4681]={o="Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine.",r={"Sea Turtle Remains (1)"},s="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde",e="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde"},
[4701]={o="Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",r={"Halycon (1)"}},
[4721]={o="Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to hunt 10 Berserk Owlbeasts in Winterspring.",r={"Berserk Owlbeast (10)"}},
[4722]={o="Take the Sea Turtle Remains to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",s="Beached Sea Turtle",e="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde"},
[4723]={o="Take the Sea Creature Bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",s="Beached Sea Creature",e="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde"},
