[7815]={o="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task.",r={"Saltwater Snapjaw (15)"}},
[7816]={o="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill Gammerita and retrieve Katoom's Best Lure from her corpse. Katoom mentioned that Gammerita hangs out on the coast with the other turtles.",r={"Katoom's Best Lure (1)"}},
