[7877]={o="Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!"},
[7905]={o="Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival."},
[7908]={o="Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena."},
[7926]={o="Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival."},
[7946]={o="I'm so happy Jubjub is no longer lost. &nbsp;She loves Dark Iron ale so much that when I ran out... she ran away to find more! Now that Jubjub's back, I want as much ale as I can get! &nbsp;I won't want her to run away again! Do you have any Dark Iron Ale? &nbsp;If you do, then I'll trade you one of Jubjub's frog eggs for a mug...",r={"Dark Iron Ale Mug (1)"},s="Morja",e="Morja"},
[7961]={o="Kill 5 rabbits and return to Jon LeCraft by the forge on Designer Island.",r={"Polymorph Clone (60)","The Good Rabbit (60)","Zap a Polymorphed Chicken (1)"}},
[7962]={o="Bring 3 LeCrafty Rabbit Pelts to Jon LeCraft.",r={"LeCraft Rabbit Pelt (3)"}},
[8021]={r={"iCoke Prize Voucher (1)"}},
[8022]={r={"iCoke Prize Voucher (1)"}},
[8023]={r={"iCoke Prize Voucher (1)"}},
[8024]={r={"iCoke Prize Voucher (1)"}},
[8025]={r={"iCoke Prize Voucher (1)"}},
[8026]={r={"iCoke Prize Voucher (1)"}},
[8041]={o="Hail, &lt;class&gt;. I am Jin'rokh the Breaker, troll of Mugamba. We of the Zandalar tribe recognize your accomplishments. We salute your tenacity and strength of will. Wear this talisman around your neck, &lt;class&gt;. Let the strength of Mount Mugamba flow through your being. Be empowered as you strike down our enemies!"},
[8042]={o="It is good to see you in good health, &lt;name&gt;. The glorious battles you have undertaken affect all life on this planet. Hakkar must never leave the confines of Zul'Gurub as the world will surely collapse beneath his immense hunger. Give me your talisman and I shall amplify its strength. Use the Strength of Mugamba to punish our enemies!",r={"Strength of Mugamba (1)"}},
[8043]={o="Master &lt;name&gt;, you return! Molthor has sent word of your deeds to the King. Your name is known even in the South Seas. Perhaps one day you will be a legendary &lt;class&gt; - a story for the ages. Give me your talisman so that I may once more amplify its power.",r={"Strength of Mugamba (1)"}},
[8044]={o="King Rastakhan sends his regards, Master &lt;name&gt;. Such an honor has never been given to one outside the Zandalar tribe. Give me your talisman so that I may enhance it once more. Know that the Rage of Mugamba is now intrinsically connected to your very soul.",r={"Strength of Mugamba (1)"}},
[8045]={o="Know this, heathen: A catastrophe has brought us together. Your pagan ways are neither understood nor appreciated by Zandalar but we are a fair people. Wear this brand around your neck. It shall serve as both a warning to our enemies and a symbol of your friendship to Zandalar. Continue to serve our people and I will amplify the power of the brand."},
[8046]={o="I may have been too hasty in my judgement, &lt;class&gt;. It seems as if your blind faith in this Light has some value after all. Give me your brand and I shall amplify its power.",r={"Heathen's Brand (1)"}},
[8047]={o="I must confess, I did not think you had the resolution to see this cause through, &lt;class&gt;. Zandalar now considers you an invaluable ally. Well done, indeed. Give me your brand and I shall once more amplify its power.",r={"Heathen's Brand (1)"}},
[8048]={o="The King has acknowledged your existence, &lt;class&gt;. You are the first of your kind to be accepted by Rastakhan as a true ally of Zandalar. You will be rewarded greatly for your efforts. Present your brand and I shall apply the final amplification.",r={"Heathen's Brand (1)"}},
[8049]={o="Accept this talisman as a token of our appreciation, &lt;class&gt;. The Eye of Zuldazar will grow in power as your bond with the trolls of Zandalar strengthens. Return to me periodically and I shall imbue the jewel."},
[8050]={o="Welcome &lt;class&gt;. The Eye of Zuldazar pulses with energy. You are ready to take the next step. Hand me the talisman and I shall perform the imbue.",r={"The Eye of Zuldazar (1)"}},
[8051]={o="Tales of your battles against the Gurubashi are whispered in the winds, &lt;class&gt;. Even royalty is beginning to talk of your deeds. It is rumored that King Rastakhan even mentioned you by name. The time has come to imbue the Eye. Hand me the talisman and I shall perform the service.",r={"The Eye of Zuldazar (1)"}},
[8052]={o="If only we had ten-thousand more like you, &lt;name&gt;. The armies of Hakkar would be scattered to the wind in the blink of an eye. Alas, the Eye is ready to realize its full potential. Give it to me.",r={"The Eye of Zuldazar (1)"}},
[8053]={o="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker Primal Hakkari Bindings. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe. Jin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Bindings (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8054]={o="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Shawl. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe. Jin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Shawl (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8055]={o="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Tabard. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe. Jin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Tabard (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8056]={o="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Armsplint. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe. Maywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Armsplint (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8057]={o="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Stanchion. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe. Maywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Stanchion (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8058]={o="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Armsplint. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe. Jin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Armsplint (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8059]={o="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Stanchion. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe. Al'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Stanchion (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8060]={o="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing Primal Hakkari Bindings. &nbsp;You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe. Al'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",r={"Primal Hakkari Bindings (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
