[8187]={o="Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord. The second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",r={"Primal Hakkari Idol (1)","Punctured Voodoo Doll (1)"}},
[8188]={o="Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord. The second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",r={"Primal Hakkari Idol (1)","Punctured Voodoo Doll (1)"}},
[8189]={o="Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord. The second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",r={"Primal Hakkari Idol (1)","Punctured Voodoo Doll (1)"}},
[8190]={o="Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord. The second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",r={"Primal Hakkari Idol (1)","Punctured Voodoo Doll (1)"}},
[8191]={o="Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord. The second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",r={"Primal Hakkari Idol (1)","Punctured Voodoo Doll (1)"}},
[8192]={o="Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord. The second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo piles. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",r={"Primal Hakkari Idol (1)","Punctured Voodoo Doll (1)"}},
[8193]={o="Today between 2pm and 4pm we have a contest to determine who the greatest angler of them all is! &nbsp; Just be the FIRST PERSON to bring me 40 Tastyfish fished from the Tastyfish schools found along the coast of Stranglethorn before anyone else does and you will be declared the Master Angler! If you are not the first person to bring me 40 fish, my apprentice here will still reward you with money for each 5 Tastyfish you bring her. Oh, and don't delay, Tastyfish go bad quickly!",r={"Speckled Tastyfish (40)"}},
[8194]={o="Even though we already have a contest winner, I will still buy your Tastyfish from you at a reasonable price. &nbsp; Whadda ya say!",r={"Speckled Tastyfish (5)"}},
[8195]={o="I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes. &nbsp;They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo. There are nine distinct kinds to be found. &nbsp;Some are sought after by my compatriots for various armors they offer Zandalar heroes. &nbsp;Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three. &nbsp;You may use the Tokens with Rin'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.",r={"Zulian Coin (1)","Razzashi Coin (1)","Hakkari Coin (1)"}},
[8196]={o="The extremely potent essence mango grows across many of the islands in the South Seas. &nbsp;A single mango will refresh those who eat it, both physically and mentally. &nbsp;If you've never had one, you do yourself a disservice! We have enough of a supply here on the isle to offer you a handful in exchange for a Zandalar Honor Token. &nbsp;Speak with Vinchaxa if you need to learn how to get tokens; otherwise, let's get to the business at hand!",r={"Zandalar Honor Token (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8201]={o="String 5 Channeler's Heads, then return the Collection of Troll Heads to Exzhal on Yojamba Isle.",r={"Gurubashi Head Collection (1)","Channeler's Head (5)"}},
[8221]={o="*Whir* *Click* &nbsp;I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. &nbsp; If you bring me a Keefer's Angelfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. *Zzzap* *Whir*",r={"Keefer's Angelfish (1)"}},
[8224]={o="*Whir* *Click* &nbsp;I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. &nbsp; If you bring me a Dezian Queenfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. *Zzzap* *Whir*",r={"Dezian Queenfish (1)"}},
[8225]={o="*Whir* *Click* &nbsp;I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. &nbsp; If you bring me a Brownell's Blue Striped Racer, I will provide you with this fine reward. *Zzzap* *Whir*",r={"Brownell's Blue Striped Racer (1)"}},
[8227]={o="Return Nat's Measuring Tape to Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh."},
[8228]={o="There is a Fishing Contest in Booty Bay this Sunday! &nbsp; Here are the rules of the tournament if you want to participate!"},
[8229]={o="There be a Fishin Contest in Booty Bay this Sunday! &nbsp; Here are the rules for ya!"},
[8231]={o="Bring 6 Wavethrasher Scales to Ogtinc in Azshara. &nbsp;Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",r={"Wavethrasher Scales (6)"}},
[8232]={o="Bring the Tooth of Morphaz to Ogtinc in Azshara. &nbsp;Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",r={"Tooth of Morphaz (1)"}},
[8233]={o="Speak with Lord Jorach Ravenholdt in Ravenholdt Manor."},
[8234]={o="Retrieve the Sealed Azure Bag from the Timbermaw Shaman in Azshara. &nbsp;Then take the bag to Archmage Xylem, also found in Azshara.",r={"Sealed Azure Bag (1)"}},
[8235]={o="Bring 10 Encoded Fragments to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.",r={"Encoded Fragment (10)"}},
[8236]={o="Return the Azure Key to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt.",r={"Azure Key (1)"}},
[8238]={o="I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes. &nbsp;They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo. There are nine distinct kinds to be found. &nbsp;Some are sought after by my compatriots for various armors they offer Zandalar heroes. &nbsp;Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three. &nbsp;You may use the Tokens with Rin'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.",r={"Gurubashi Coin (1)","Vilebranch Coin (1)","Witherbark Coin (1)"}},
[8239]={o="I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes. &nbsp;They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo. There are nine distinct kinds to be found. &nbsp;Some are sought after by my compatriots for various armors they offer Zandalar heroes. &nbsp;Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three. &nbsp;You may use the Tokens with Rin'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.",r={"Sandfury Coin (1)","Skullsplitter Coin (1)","Bloodscalp Coin (1)"}},
[8240]={o="Destroy any one of the Hakkari Bijous found in Zul'Gurub at the Altar of Zanza on Yojamba Isle. &nbsp;When done, speak with Vinchaxa nearby."},
[8241]={o="Let's not waste more of my precious time with jibber jabber, &lt;race&gt;. It's time to focus on replenishing our dwindling fiery flux supply. What I'm gonna need from you is the following: *Incendosaur scales. *Iron bars. *Coal. I'll take all that you can offer! And you'll do it fast if you wanna get in good with the Brotherhood.",r={"Incendosaur Scale (2)","Iron Bar (4)","Coal (1)"}},
[8242]={o="Let's not waste more of my precious time with jibber jabber, &lt;race&gt;. It's time to focus on replenishing our dwindling fiery flux supply. What I'm gonna need from you is the following: *Incendosaur scales. *Heavy Leather. *Coal. I'll take all that you can offer! And you'll do it fast if you wanna get in good with the Brotherhood.",r={"Incendosaur Scale (2)","Heavy Leather (10)","Coal (1)"}},
[8243]={o="With your increased status amongst the tribe comes access to some of our more potent potables. &nbsp;Behold... these brews are strong in the mojo - blessed by Zanza and fit for adventurers from all walks of life! I will allow you to choose one from the three I offer; in exchange, I require one Zandalar Honor Token. &nbsp;Note that only the effects of a single one may course through your spirit at any given time. Let me know when you're ready to barter!",r={"Zandalar Honor Token (1)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8246]={o="&lt;name&gt; - for someone as exalted among the Zandalar as you are, I have something very special for you. &nbsp;Direct from our home in the South Seas... the Signets of the Zandalar! &nbsp;These signets are used to enhance any shoulder item you may possess. &nbsp;Should you seek might, mojo, or serenity - I have what you need! I ask for fifteen Zandalar Honor Tokens in exchange for your choice of one signet. &nbsp;If you have the tokens ready, then I'm ready to make a deal!",r={"Zandalar Honor Token (15)","Zandalar Tribe: (1)"}},
[8249]={o="My rogues need to hone their lockpicking skills, and I need locks of adequate difficulty -- the stuff Zan makes us is unfit for all but the lowliest neophytes. Tell ya what, if you bring me 5 Heavy Junkboxes, I'll provide you with some of the finest throwing knives known to roguekind. You can unlock the boxes and rifle through them, but you'll have to leave at least a few coins in them... even a &lt;class&gt; in training needs motivation.",r={"Heavy Junkbox (5)"}},
[8250]={o="Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem."},
[8251]={o="Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem.",r={"Glittering Dust (10)"}},
[8252]={o="Collect 6 Enchanted Coral and return them to Archmage Xylem.",r={"Enchanted Coral (6)"}},
[8253]={o="Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem.",r={"Arcane Shard (1)"}},
[8254]={o="Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara."},
[8255]={o="Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara. &nbsp;Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",r={"Healthy Courser Gland (4)"}},
[8256]={o="Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara. &nbsp;Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",r={"Ichor of Undeath (1)"}},
[8257]={o="Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. &nbsp;The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows.",r={"Blood of Morphaz (1)"}},
[8258]={o="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. &nbsp;Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. &nbsp;Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him. Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",r={"Darkreaver's Head (1)"}},
[8259]={o="Ah, &lt;name&gt;... your effort against Darkreaver was extraordinary - an effort, may I add, that deserved a much better reward than you received. &nbsp;Please, accept this helm as an additional gift to you for your accomplishments in Scholomance. Again, thank you."},
[8273]={o="Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately."},
[8274]={o="Kill 5 Murlocs and come back to the test character.",r={"Murloc Coastrunner (5)"}},
[8275]={o="Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."},
[8276]={o="Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."},
[8277]={o="Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 8 Stonelash Scorpid Stingers and 8 Sand Skitterer Fangs. Return to her when you have completed the task.",r={"Stonelash Scorpid Stinger (8)","Sand Skitterer Fang (8)"}},
[8278]={o="Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 3 Stonelash Pincer Stingers, 3 Stonelash Flayer Stingers and 3 Rock Stalker Fangs.",r={"Stonelash Flayer Stinger (3)","Stonelash Pincer Stinger (3)","Rock Stalker Fang (3)"}},
[8279]={o="Bring the three chapters of the Twilight Lexicon to Hermit Ortell in Silithus. &nbsp;",r={"Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 1 (1)","Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 2 (1)","Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 3 (1)"}},
[8280]={o="Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to kill 15 Dredge Strikers.",r={"Dredge Striker (15)"}},
[8281]={o="Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to slay 20 Dredge Crushers.",r={"Dredge Crusher (20)"}},
[8282]={o="Retrieve Noggle's Satchel from the mountains in the south of Silithus and return it to him at Cenarion Hold.",r={"Noggle's Satchel (1)"}},
[8283]={o="Bring Deathclasp's Pincer to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard.",r={"Deathclasp's Pincer (1)"}},
[8284]={o="Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to collect 8 Twilight Tablet Fragments.",r={"Twilight Tablet Fragment (8)"}},
[8285]={o="Take the restored tablet to Hermit Ortell in Silithus."},
[8286]={o="Venture to the Caverns of Time in Tanaris and find Anachronos, Brood of Nozdormu.",r={"(1)","Discover the Brood of Nozdormu. (1)"}},
[8287]={o="Take the Decoded Tablet Parchment to Commander Mar'alith."},
[8288]={o="Return the Head of the Broodlord Lashlayer to Baristolth of the Shifting Sands at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",r={"Head of the Broodlord Lashlayer (1)"}},
[8301]={o="Collect 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments and return to Baristolth.",r={"Silithid Carapace Fragment (200)"}},
[8302]={o="Collect 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments and return to Baristolth.",r={"Silithid Carapace Fragment (200)"}},
[8303]={o="Seek out Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris."},
[8304]={o="Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to question the inhabitants of Bronzebeard's Encampment. You will find Bronzebeard's Encampment south of Cenarion Hold. Once you have gathered the requested information, return to Commander Mar'alith.",r={"Frankal Questioned (1)","Rutgar Questioned (1)"}},
[8305]={o="Locate the Crystalline Tear in Silithus and gaze into its depths."},
[8306]={o="Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith. Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you. And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\"",r={"The Fate of Mistress Natalia Mar'alith (1)"}},
[8307]={o="Look for information about cooking Sandworm Meat at the Twilight's Hammer camp west of Cenarion Hold."},
[8308]={o="Take Brann Bronzebeard's Letter to Bronzebeard's Encampment in southern Silithus."},
[8309]={o="Rutgar Glyphshaper at Bronzebeard's Encampment in Silithus wants you to venture to Hive'Ashi, Hive'Zora, and Hive'Regal and recover Glyphed Rubbings from the Glyphed Crystals of each hive. Use the Geologist's Transcription Kit to make a reasonable facsimile of the ancient glyphs. Return to Rutgar Glyphshaper when you complete this task.",r={"Hive'Ashi Rubbing (1)","Hive'Zora Rubbing (1)","Hive'Regal Rubbing (1)"}},
[8310]={o="Frankal Stonebridge at Bronzebeard's Encampment in Silithus wants you to recover a Hive'Zora Silithid Brain, Hive'Ashi Silithid Brain, and a Hive'Regal Silithid Brain. Return to Frankal when you have completed this task.",r={"Hive'Ashi Silithid Brain (1)","Hive'Zora Silithid Brain (1)","Hive'Regal Silithid Brain (1)"}},
[8313]={o="Bring the Torn Recipe Page to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold."},
[8314]={o="Rutgar Glyphshaper at Bronzebeard's Encampment wants you to deliver the Glyphed Crystal Prism to Geologist Larksbane at the Cenarion Hold in Silithus."},
[8315]={o="Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to recover the Crystal Unlocking Mechanism from the Qiraji Emissary. You have been instructed to take the Glyphs of Calling to the Bones of Grakkarond, south of Cenarion Hold, and draw them in the sand. Should the Qiraji Emissary appear, slay it and recover the Crystal Unlocking Mechanism. Return to Geologist Larksbane if you succeed. Assemble an army for this task, &lt;name&gt;!",r={"Crystal Unlocking Mechanism (1)"}},
[8316]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8317]={o="Calandrath at Cenarion Hold needs a batch of 10 Smoked Desert Dumplings.",r={"Smoked Desert Dumplings (10)"}},
[8318]={o="Bring 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Encrypted Twilight Text (10)"}},
[8319]={o="Keep bringing me texts. &nbsp;We'll soon force the Twilight's Hammer out of Silithus.",r={"Encrypted Twilight Text (10)"}},
[8320]={o="Kill 10 Twilight Geolords, then return to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Twilight Geolord (10)"}},
[8321]={o="Bring Vyral's Signet Ring to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Vyral's Signet Ring (1)"}},
[8323]={o="Hermit Ortell wants you to bring him 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts",r={"Encrypted Twilight Text (10)"}},
[8324]={o="Find any more encrypted texts? &nbsp;Bring me a good batch of them, this decoding work takes some time.",r={"Encrypted Twilight Text (10)"}},
[8331]={o="Speak with Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold."},
[8332]={o="Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard and 3 Abyssal Crests to Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Large Brilliant Shard (1)","Abyssal Crest (3)"}},
[8333]={o="If you need another Twilight cultist's medallion of station, then I am happy to oblige. &nbsp;I will, however, need another brilliant shard and some abyssal crests...",r={"Large Brilliant Shard (1)","Abyssal Crest (3)"}},
[8341]={o="Bring 5 Large Brilliant Shards and 3 Abyssal Signets to Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Large Brilliant Shard (5)","Abyssal Signet (3)"}},
[8342]={o="&lt;name&gt;, if you plan to go after the Abysall High Council again, then you'll need another Twilight ring of lordship. &nbsp;Bring me more shards and signets and I'll make one for you.",r={"Abyssal Signet (3)","Large Brilliant Shard (5)"}},
[8343]={o="Speak with Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold."},
[8348]={o="Bring the Abyssal Signet to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Abyssal Signet (1)"}},
[8349]={o="Speak with Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold."},
[8351]={o="Speak with Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold."},
[8352]={o="Bring an Abyssal Scepter to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",r={"Abyssal Scepter (1)"}},
[8361]={o="Bor Wildmane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to destroy an Abyssal Templar and bring him an Abyssal Crest as proof of the deed.",r={"Abyssal Crest (1)"}},
[8362]={o="You've proved you can handle yourself in a fight, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Let's keep the pressure up on the Twilight's Hammer. &nbsp;Go fight some more Abyssal Templars, I'll reward you with some of the stuff Huum and I have found in battle.",r={"Abyssal Crest (3)"}},
[8363]={o="You've shown you're more than capable of taking on an Abyssal Duke, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;I'm always one to promote good habits. &nbsp;Bring me more signets and I'll give you a reward.",r={"Abyssal Signet (3)"}},
[8364]={o="You've truly exceeded all my expectations, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;You've been taking on opponents that Huum and I would think long and hard before engaging. At this point the best I can do is to continue rewarding your efforts in the fight against the Twilight's Hammer and their overlords. Bring me more abyssal scepters and I'll do my best to give you a suitable reward.",r={"Abyssal Scepter (3)"}},
[8365]={o="Haughty Modiste wants you to collect 20 Southsea Pirate Hats and return them to her at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",r={"Southsea Pirate Hat (20)"}},
[8366]={o="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.",r={"Southsea Pirate (10)","Southsea Freebooter (10)","Southsea Dock Worker (10)","Southsea Swashbuckler (10)"}},
[8367]={o="Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor, 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor and 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.",r={"Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)","Arathi Basin Mark of Honor (3)","Alterac Valley Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8375]={o="Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.",r={"Alterac Valley Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8376]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8377]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8378]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8379]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8380]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8381]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8382]={o="War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded. Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass... The future of us all could be at an end. These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert."},
[8383]={o="The Battle in Alterac Valley rages on, &lt;name&gt;! &nbsp;Have you done your part as of late, &lt;name&gt;?",r={"Alterac Valley Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8384]={o="The war against the Horde is quickly depleting our supplies, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;It is vital to maintain control of Arathi Basin to keep the stream of resources flowing! &nbsp;Have you lent a hand in Arathi yet?",r={"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor (3)"},s="Alliance Brigadier General",e="Alliance Brigadier General"},
[8385]={o="Ah, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;I hope you continue to lend your experience to the different battlefronts. &nbsp;A lot of our lads and lasses in the field look up to seasoned veterans like you.",r={"Alterac Valley Mark of Honor (3)","Arathi Basin Mark of Honor (3)","Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8387]={o="The battle for Alterac rages on! &nbsp;You must return to Alterac Valley and once more drive the invaders out of Frostwolf territory, &lt;name&gt;!",r={"Alterac Valley Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8388]={o="Many brave fighters look up to you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;You continue to be an example for all in the fight against the Alliance. &nbsp;What news do you bring from your journeys?",r={"Alterac Valley Mark of Honor (3)","Arathi Basin Mark of Honor (3)","Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8404]={o="Don't forget the fight for Warsong Gulch is about more than just protecting trees. &nbsp;It's about keeping a natural barrier between Ashenvale and the Barrens. &nbsp;Do you bring any news from the battlefield, &lt;name&gt;? &nbsp;",r={"Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)"},s="Alliance Brigadier General",e="Alliance Brigadier General"},
[8405]={o="Don't forget the fight for Warsong Gulch is about more than just protecting trees. &nbsp;It's about keeping a natural barrier between Ashenvale and the Barrens. &nbsp;Do you bring any news from the battlefield, &lt;name&gt;?",r={"Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8406]={o="Don't forget the fight for Warsong Gulch is about more than just protecting trees. &nbsp;It's about keeping a natural barrier between Ashenvale and the Barrens. &nbsp;Do you bring any news from the battlefield, &lt;name&gt;?",r={"Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8408]={o="Don't forget the fight for Warsong Gulch is about more than just protecting trees. &nbsp;It's about keeping a natural barrier between Ashenvale and the Barrens. &nbsp;Do you bring any news from the battlefield, &lt;name&gt;?",r={"Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8410]={o="Collect a sample of air, fire, earth and water for Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",r={"Elemental Air (1)","Elemental Fire (1)","Elemental Earth (1)","Elemental Water (1)"}},
[8411]={o="Bring the elements earth, air, fire and water to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",r={"Elemental Air (1)","Elemental Earth (1)","Elemental Fire (1)","Elemental Water (1)"}},
[8412]={o="Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",r={"Bloodshot Spider Eye (8)","Thick Black Claw (8)"}},
[8413]={o="Bring the voodoo feathers to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",r={"Amber Voodoo Feather (2)","Blue Voodoo Feather (2)","Green Voodoo Feather (2)"}},
[8414]={o="Collect 20 Minion's Scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis in the Western Plaguelands.",r={"Minion's Scourgestone (20)"}},
[8415]={o="Speak to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Point."},
[8416]={o="Bring the Inert Scourgestone to Commander Ashlan Valorfist in Chillwind Point."},
[8417]={o="Speak with the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the entrance to the Blasted Lands."},
[8418]={o="Bring the voodoo feathers to Ashlam Valorfist.",r={"Amber Voodoo Feather (2)","Blue Voodoo Feather (2)","Green Voodoo Feather (2)"}},
[8419]={o="Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.",r={"Felcloth (1)"}},
[8420]={o="Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.",r={"Felcloth (1)"}},
[8421]={o="Bring 10 Rotting Wood and 4 Bloodvenom Essence to Impsy in Felwood.",r={"Rotting Wood (10)","Bloodvenom Essence (4)"}},
[8422]={o="Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple.",r={"Amber Voodoo Feather (2)","Blue Voodoo Feather (2)","Green Voodoo Feather (2)"}},
[8423]={o="Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",r={"Helboar (7)"}},
[8424]={o="Slaughter the Shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",r={"Shadowsworn Adept (20)","Shadowsworn Cultist (10)","Shadowsworn Thug (20)"}},
[8425]={o="Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",r={"Amber Voodoo Feather (2)","Blue Voodoo Feather (2)","Green Voodoo Feather (2)"}},
[8438]={o="Bring 3 Arathi Basin Mark of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.",r={"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor (3)"}},
[8446]={o="Find someone capable of deciphering the meaning behind the Nightmare Engulfed Object. Perhaps a druid of great power could assist you."},
[8447]={o="Wait for Keeper Remulos at the Moonglade to cleanse the Nightmare Engulfed Object.",r={"Waking Legends. (1)"}},
[8460]={o="Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 6 Deadwood Warriors, 6 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 6 Deadwood Gardeners. &nbsp;Return to him in southern Felwood near the Emerald Sanctuary when you are done.",r={"Deadwood Warrior (6)","Deadwood Pathfinder (6)","Deadwood Gardener (6)"}},
[8461]={o="Nafien would like you to kill 6 Deadwood Den Watchers, 6 Deadwood Avengers, and 6 Deadwood Shamans. &nbsp;Return to him in northern Felwood near the entrance to Timbermaw Hold.",r={"Deadwood Den Watcher (6)","Deadwood Avenger (6)","Deadwood Shaman (6)"}},
[8462]={o="Travel north along the main road in Felwood and speak with the furbolg named Nafien. &nbsp;He stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold."},
[8464]={o="Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. &nbsp;Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",r={"Winterfall Shaman (8)","Winterfall Den Watcher (8)","Winterfall Ursa (8)"}},
[8465]={o="Travel through Timbermaw Hold and exit into Winterspring. &nbsp;Speak with Salfa, who stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold."},
[8466]={o="While you have proven yourself to me, you may need to continue to work toward proving yourself to the suspicious brethren of my tribe. &nbsp;To that end, I may be able to continue assisting you. Some of the Deadwood furbolgs wear a distinctive headdress that may be used as a means of proof in thinning their numbers. &nbsp;Bring me a feather from any headdresses you acquire; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.",r={"Deadwood Headdress Feather (5)"}},
[8467]={o="While you have proven yourself to me, you may need to continue to work toward proving yourself to the suspicious brethren of my tribe. &nbsp;To that end, I may be able to continue assisting you. Some of the Deadwood furbolgs wear a distinctive headdress that may be used as a means of proof in thinning their numbers. &nbsp;Bring me a feather from any headdresses you acquire; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.",r={"Deadwood Headdress Feather (5)"}},
[8469]={o="You've certainly earned my trust, &lt;name&gt;, but you may need to continue to earn the trust of my untrusting tribe. &nbsp;There is something you can do to earn that trust. The Winterfall are known to carry spirit beads to ward against foul spirits. &nbsp;These beads have clearly failed in their purpose, as the Winterfall themselves are the agents of corruption. &nbsp;Bring to me these spirit beads from fallen Winterfall furbolgs; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.",r={"Winterfall Spirit Beads (5)"}},
[8470]={o="Take the Deadwood Ritual Totem inside Timbermaw Hold and see if one of the furbolgs there will find a use for the item. &nbsp;The Timbermaw will not speak with you unless you are of Neutral reputation or greater with them.",r={"Timbermaw Hold: (1)"}},
[8471]={o="Take the Winterfall Ritual Totem inside Timbermaw Hold and see if one of the furbolgs there will find a use for the item. &nbsp;The Timbermaw will not speak with you unless you are of Neutral reputation or greater with them.",r={"Timbermaw Hold: (1)"}},
[8481]={o="Plant the Demon Summoning Torch in the mouth of High Chief Winterfall's cave in the Winterfall furbolg village. &nbsp;Defeat the demon and retrieve the Essence of Xandivious for Gorn One Eye in Timbermaw Hold.",r={"Essence of Xandivious (1)","Timbermaw Hold: (1)"}},
[8484]={o="Bring the Timbermaw Offering of Peace to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",r={"Timbermaw Hold: (1)"}},
[8485]={o="Bring the Timbermaw Offering of Peace to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",r={"Timbermaw Hold: (1)"}},
[8492]={o="Bring 20 Copper Bars to Sergeant Stonebrow at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Copper Bar (20)"}},
[8493]={o="Bring 20 copper bars to Sergeant Stonebrow at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Copper Bar (20)"}},
[8494]={o="Bring 20 Iron Bars to Corporal Carnes at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Iron Bar (20)"}},
[8495]={o="Bring 20 iron bars to Corporal Carnes at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Iron Bar (20)"}},
[8496]={o="Bring 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, 30 Heavy Silk Bandages and 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandages to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",r={"Heavy Runecloth Bandage (30)","Heavy Mageweave Bandage (30)","Heavy Silk Bandage (30)"}},
[8497]={o="Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",r={"Globe of Water (4)","Powerful Anti-Venom (4)","Smoked Desert Dumplings (4)"}},
[8498]={o="Obtain the Twilight Battle Orders and bring them Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",r={"Twilight Battle Orders (1)"}},
[8499]={o="Bring 20 Thorium Bars to Dame Twinbraid at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Thorium Bar (20)"}},
[8500]={o="Bring 20 thorium bars to Dame Twinbraid at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Thorium Bar (20)"}},
[8501]={o="Kill 30 Hive'Ashi Stingers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing XII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Ashi Stinger (30)"}},
[8502]={o="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Workers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Ashi Worker (30)"}},
[8503]={o="Bring 20 Stranglekelp to Private Draxlegauge at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Stranglekelp (20)"}},
[8504]={o="Bring 20 stranglekelp to Private Draxlegauge at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Stranglekelp (20)"}},
[8505]={o="Bring 20 Purple Lotus to Master Nightsong at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Purple Lotus (20)"}},
[8506]={o="Bring 20 purple lotus to Master Nightsong at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Purple Lotus (20)"}},
[8507]={o="Report for duty at the Ironforge Brigade post near Hive'Zora. &nbsp;Prepare your Unsigned Field Duty Papers and obtain Signed Field Duty Papers from Captain Blackanvil and return to Windcaller Kaldon at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. Note: Healing or casting beneficial spells on a member of the Ironforge Brigade will flag you for PvP.",r={"Signed Field Duty Papers (1)"}},
[8508]={o="I take it you want those papers signed, lad? &nbsp;",r={"Prepared Field Duty Papers (1)"}},
[8509]={o="Bring 20 Arthas' Tears to Sergeant Major Germaine at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Arthas' Tears (20)"}},
[8510]={o="Bring 20 arthas' tears to Sergeant Major Germaine at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Arthas' Tears (20)"}},
[8511]={o="Bring 10 Light Leather to Bonnie Stoneflayer at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Light Leather (10)"}},
[8512]={o="Bring 10 light leather to Bonnie Stoneflayer at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Light Leather (10)"}},
[8513]={o="Bring 10 Medium Leather to Private Porter at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Medium Leather (10)"}},
[8514]={o="Bring 10 medium leather to Private Porter at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Medium Leather (10)"}},
[8515]={o="Bring 10 Thick Leather to Marta Finespindle at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Thick Leather (10)"}},
[8516]={o="Bring 10 thick leather to Marta Finespindle at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Thick Leather (10)"}},
[8517]={o="Bring 20 Linen Bandages to Sentinel Silversky at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Linen Bandage (20)"}},
[8518]={o="Bring 20 linen bandages to Sentinel Silversky at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Linen Bandage (20)"}},
[8519]={o="Learn all that you can of the past, then speak with Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.",r={"The War of the Shifting Sands (1)"}},
[8520]={o="Bring 20 Silk Bandages to Nurse Stonefield at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Silk Bandage (20)"}},
[8521]={o="Bring 20 silk bandages to Nurse Stonefield at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Silk Bandage (20)"}},
[8522]={o="Bring 20 Runecloth Bandages to Keeper Moonshade at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Runecloth Bandage (20)"}},
[8523]={o="Bring 20 runecloth bandages to Keeper Moonshade at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Runecloth Bandage (20)"}},
[8524]={o="Bring 20 Rainbow Fin Albacore to Slicky Gastronome at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Rainbow Fin Albacore (20)"}},
[8525]={o="Bring 20 rainbow fin albacore to Slicky Gastronome at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Rainbow Fin Albacore (20)"}},
[8526]={o="Bring 20 Roast Raptor to Sarah Sadwhistle at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Roast Raptor (20)"}},
[8527]={o="Bring 20 roast raptor to Sarah Sadwhistle at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Roast Raptor (20)"}},
[8528]={o="Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to Huntress Swiftriver at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",r={"Spotted Yellowtail (20)"}},
[8529]={o="Bring 20 spotted yellowtail to Huntress Swiftriver at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Spotted Yellowtail (20)"}},
[8530]={o="Bring 50 singed corestones to Commander Stronghammer at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",r={"Singed Corestone (50)"}},
[8532]={o="Bring 20 Copper Bars to Miner Cromwell at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Copper Bar (20)"}},
[8533]={o="Bring 20 copper bars to Miner Cromwell in Durotar.",r={"Copper Bar (20)"}},
[8534]={o="Contact Cenarion Scout Azenel inside Hive'Zora and return the Hive'Zora Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Zora Scout Report (1)"}},
[8535]={o="Summon and slay a Hoary Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hoary Templar (1)"}},
[8536]={o="Summon and slay an Earthen Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",r={"Earthen Templar (1)"}},
[8537]={o="Summon and slay a Crimson Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",r={"Crimson Templar (1)"}},
[8538]={o="Find a way to summon and slay the Duke of Cynders, the Duke of Fathoms, the Duke of Zephyrs and the Duke of Shards and report back to Commander Mar'alith in Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",r={"The Duke of Cynders (1)","The Duke of Fathoms (1)","The Duke of Zephyrs (1)","The Duke of Shards (1)"}},
[8539]={o="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Hive Sisters and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Zora Hive Sister (30)"}},
[8540]={o="Bring 3 Ornate Mithril Boots to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",r={"Ornate Mithril Boots (3)"}},
[8541]={o="Bring 10 Dense Grinding Stones, 10 Solid Grinding Stones and 10 Heavy Grinding Stones to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",r={"Dense Grinding Stone (10)","Solid Grinding Stone (10)","Heavy Grinding Stone (10)"}},
[8542]={o="Bring 20 Tin Bars to Grunt Maug at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Tin Bar (20)"}},
[8543]={o="Bring 20 tin bars to Grunt Maug in Durotar.",r={"Tin Bar (20)"}},
[8544]={o="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Bindings of Command (1)","Idol of Night (2)","Clay Scarab (5)","Stone Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8545]={o="Bring 20 Mithril Bars to Senior Sergeant T'kelah at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Mithril Bar (20)"}},
[8546]={o="Yup, I be glad you're here, mon. You helped me before, and now I need your help again. We still lookin' ta bring in more mithril bars for the war effort; gonna build lots of armor and weapons and things to go squish them bugs at Ahn'Qiraj. So if you be a true friend, you bring me back more stacks of mithril bars. I take all you got until we hit our quota. You have some for me now?",r={"Mithril Bar (20)"}},
[8548]={o="Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",r={"Cenarion Combat Badge (5)","Cenarion Logistics Badge (3)","Cenarion Tactical Badge (7)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8549]={o="Bring 20 Peacebloom to Herbalist Proudfeather at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Peacebloom (20)"}},
[8550]={o="Hello again, &lt;name&gt;. I am glad that you wish to speak to me once more concerning our neverending need for peacebloom. The war effort continues, and with it our production of potions and elixirs to aid in the battles to come. Will you help us again, &lt;class&gt;? I am in need of the same amount of peacebloom as before, so if you can gather it up and return it to me here I would be most grateful. Of course, if you already have it on your person, I will be more than happy to accept it from you now.",r={"Peacebloom (20)"}},
[8551]={o="Bring Smotts' Chest to Hecklebury Smotts in Booty Bay.",r={"Smotts' Chest (1)"}},
[8552]={o="Return the Monogrammed Sash to its owner."},
[8553]={o="Speak with Sprogger."},
[8554]={o="Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat. Kill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.",r={"Smotts' Cutlass (1)"}},
[8555]={o="Eranikus, Vaelastrasz, and Azuregos... No doubt you know of these dragons, mortal. It is no coincidence, then, that they have played such influential roles as watchers of our world. Unfortunately (and my own naivety is partially to blame) whether by agents of the Old Gods or betrayal by those that would call them friend, each guardian has fallen to tragedy. The extent of which has fueled my own distrust towards your kind. Seek them out... And &lt;race&gt;, prepare yourself for the worst."},
[8556]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Lambent Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Magisterial Ring (1)","Lambent Idol (2)","Bronze Scarab (5)","Ivory Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8557]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Onyx Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Martial Drape (1)","Onyx Idol (2)","Bone Scarab (5)","Silver Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8558]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 &nbsp;Alabaster Idols, 5 Crystal Scarabs and 5 Stone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Spiked Hilt (1)","Alabaster Idol (2)","Crystal Scarab (5)","Stone Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8559]={o="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of War, 5 Ivory Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",r={"Qiraji Bindings of Command (1)","Idol of War (2)","Ivory Scarab (5)","Gold Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8560]={o="Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Ouro's Intact Hide (1)","Idol of Death (2)","Bronze Scarab (5)","Ivory Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8561]={o="Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Vek'nilash's Circlet (1)","Idol of the Sun (2)","Crystal Scarab (5)","Stone Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8562]={o="Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of War, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Carapace of the Old God (1)","Idol of War (2)","Silver Scarab (5)","Bone Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8565]={r={"Arathi Resource Crate (1)"}},
[8566]={r={"Arathi Resource Crate (1)"}},
[8567]={r={"Silverwing Talisman of Merit (1)"}},
[8568]={r={"Warsong Mark of Honor (1)"}},
[8569]={r={"Warsong Gulch Ribbon of Sacrifice (1)"}},
[8570]={r={"Warsong Gulch Ribbon of Sacrifice (1)"}},
[8572]={o="Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",r={"Cenarion Combat Badge (7)","Cenarion Logistics Badge (4)","Cenarion Tactical Badge (4)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8573]={o="Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",r={"Cenarion Combat Badge (15)","Cenarion Logistics Badge (20)","Cenarion Tactical Badge (20)","Mark of Cenarius (1)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8574]={o="Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",r={"Cenarion Combat Badge (15)","Cenarion Logistics Badge (20)","Cenarion Tactical Badge (17)","Mark of Remulos (1)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8575]={o="Deliver Azuregos's Magical Ledger to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris."},
[8576]={o="First things first, &lt;name&gt;! We need to figure out what Azuregos wrote in this ledger. You say that he's told you to make an arcanite buoy and that this is the schematic? Strange that he would write this in Draconic. That old goat knows I can't read this nonsense. If this is going to work, I'm going to need my scrying goggles, a five hundred pound chicken and volume II of \"Draconic for Dummies.\" Not necessarily in that order."},
[8577]={o="Narain Soothfancy wants you to find his ex-best friend forever (BFF), Stewvul, and take back the scrying goggles that Stewvul stole from him."},
[8578]={o="Find Narain's Scrying Goggles and return them to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",r={"Narain's Scrying Goggles (1)"}},
[8579]={o="We sense the presence of our enslaved brethren deeper inside Ahn'Qiraj; yet not even an army of dragons would be enough to rescue them, &lt;race&gt;. The same spell that imprisoned them would place us firmly under C'Thun's control should we come any closer to him. The Old God has foreseen our arrival. &nbsp;All hope is lost. &nbsp;What difference could a mere mortal like you possibly make?",r={"Qiraji Lord's Insignia (1)"}},
[8580]={o="Bring 20 Firebloom to Batrider Pele'keiki at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Firebloom (20)"}},
[8581]={o="Pele'keiki know you come to help. Bring many firebloom and make him very happy. Pele'keiki might make big bombs with firebloom. Drop them on insects from his bat over Ahn'Qiraj when war come. But Pele'keiki need more firebloom, &lt;class&gt;! You gonna bring Pele'keiki that firebloom, real quick now. Come back with at least as much as last time, and Pele'keiki be pleased.",r={"Firebloom (20)"}},
[8582]={o="Bring 20 Purple Lotus to Apothecary Jezel at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Purple Lotus (20)"}},
[8583]={o="In fact it does appear that we are in need of even more purple lotus, &lt;class&gt;. While my own studies have yet to determine a new useful application for the herb, there are tried and true methodologies yet to be employed. I need you to once again go out into the field and collect at least twenty purple lotus samples. Return them to me here.",r={"Purple Lotus (20)"}},
[8584]={o="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to speak with Dirge Quickcleave in Gadgetzan."},
[8585]={o="Recover Lakmaeran's Carcass and 20 Chimaerok Tenderloins for Dirge Quickcleave in Tanaris.",r={"Lakmaeran's Carcass (1)","Chimaerok Tenderloin (20)"}},
[8586]={o="Dirge Quickcleave in Gadgetzan wants you to bring him 20 Goblin Rocket Fuel and 20 Deeprock Salt.",r={"Goblin Rocket Fuel (20)","Deeprock Salt (20)"}},
[8587]={o="Deliver the 500 Pound Chicken to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris."},
[8588]={o="Bring 10 Heavy Leather to Skinner Jamani at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Heavy Leather (10)"}},
[8589]={o="It's true, &lt;class&gt;, I still need more heavy leather. The requests from the generals and their quartermasters seem endless. And that's nothing compared to what the zeppelin masters are asking for! I need to get my quota collected on the double. &lt;name&gt;, bring me more stacks of heavy leather as soon as you can!",r={"Heavy Leather (10)"}},
[8590]={o="Bring 10 Thick Leather to Sergeant Umala at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Thick Leather (10)"}},
[8591]={o="&lt;class&gt;, as you can see I still need to gather up more thick leather. Once again I ask your help with this task, and promise that if you complete it, you will be recognized for your efforts. Time is of the essence! Return to me with the thick leather so that we can finish our preparations and go to war, hero!",r={"Thick Leather (10)"}},
[8592]={o="Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Vek'nilash's Circlet (1)","Idol of the Sage (2)","Silver Scarab (5)","Bone Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8593]={o="Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Ouro's Intact Hide (1)","Idol of Life (2)","Gold Scarab (5)","Clay Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8594]={o="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Bindings of Command (1)","Idol of Rebirth (2)","Silver Scarab (5)","Ivory Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8595]={o="Killing one Qiraji lord is a notable accomplishment for a mortal, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;They are however, numerous and powerful. &nbsp;Continue to defeat them to prove your worth as our champion.",r={"Qiraji Lord's Insignia (1)"}},
[8596]={o="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",r={"Qiraji Bindings of Command (1)","Idol of Death (2)","Bronze Scarab (5)","Gold Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8597]={o="Find Narain Soothfancy's book, buried on an island in the South Seas."},
[8598]={o="Return the Ransom Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris."},
[8599]={o="Take Meridith's Love Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris."},
[8600]={o="Bring 10 Rugged Leather to Doctor Serratus at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Rugged Leather (10)"}},
[8601]={o="Preparations for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj are proceeding, &lt;class&gt;. However, to ensure that we do not fall behind, or at least that I am not the one that causes us to fall behind, I want for you to bring back another stack of rugged leather. Your prompt attention to this matter will be greatly appreciated, &lt;name&gt;.",r={"Rugged Leather (10)"}},
[8602]={o="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Bindings of Dominance (1)","Idol of Life (2)","Gold Scarab (5)","Crystal Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8603]={o="Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",r={"Husk of the Old God (1)","Idol of Death (2)","Stone Scarab (5)","Crystal Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
[8604]={o="Bring 20 Wool Bandages to Healer Longrunner at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Wool Bandage (20)"}},
[8605]={o="Good to see you again, &lt;class&gt;. We are still working on preparations here for the war effort, and I can still use all of the help that you can give in gathering up wool bandaging. Any assistance at all will be greatly appreciated. I only hope that our efforts will be good enough. I've lost too many noble souls on the battlefields of yesterday to not do everything in my power to see to it that doesn't happen again.",r={"Wool Bandage (20)"}},
[8606]={o="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to travel to Winterspring and place the Bag of Gold at the drop off point documented by the booknappers.",r={"Who Does Number Two Work For? (1)"}},
[8607]={o="Bring 20 Mageweave Bandages to Lady Callow at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Mageweave Bandage (20)"}},
[8608]={o="You returned? Interesting. As you can see I am still collecting for the Ahn'Qiraj 'war effort'. Which means that I need you to once again go out and collect a stack of mageweave bandages for me. I look forward to your return, &lt;class&gt;.",r={"Mageweave Bandage (20)"}},
[8609]={o="Bring 20 Runecloth Bandages to Stoneguard Clayhoof at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Runecloth Bandage (20)"}},
[8610]={o="Ever does the time grow nearer when we shall launch ourselves headlong into the conflagration at Ahn'Qiraj, &lt;class&gt;. But first we must gather our strength and prepare so that we can survive the onslaught of the insects and their masters. If you are here again, then surely you wish to make another contribution of runecloth bandages to the war effort? Please do so as soon as you can and return to me once more.",r={"Runecloth Bandage (20)"}},
[8611]={o="Bring 20 Lean Wolf Steaks to Bloodguard Rawtar at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Lean Wolf Steak (20)"}},
[8612]={o="As you can see, &lt;class&gt;, we still need to pack away more food for the soldiers. I don't know if you've ever been in a war before, but once you get past the initial shock of the battlefield, you can get pretty hungry. &nbsp;You did a good job last time, so I expect that you'll do as well, if not a little quicker, in getting me another stack of those lean wolf steaks.",r={"Lean Wolf Steak (20)"}},
[8613]={o="Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to Fisherman Lin'do at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Spotted Yellowtail (20)"}},
[8614]={o="So as you can see, we still be needin' a lot of the fishies. The combatants in the upcomin' Ahn'Qiraj War gonna be needin' a lot to eat, so I needin' to get all the spotted yellowtail that I can. You catch 'em, cook 'em, and bringin' 'em back to me here, and I be givin' you thanks, and the thanks of the Horde.",r={"Spotted Yellowtail (20)"}},
[8615]={o="Bring 20 Baked Salmon to Chief Sharpclaw at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",r={"Baked Salmon (20)"}},
[8616]={o="The last batch of baked salmon that you donated to the war effort looked very delicious, &lt;class&gt;. I must admit that I was tempted to take a few for myself. As you can tell, we have not yet reached our quota here. I am hoping you have returned because you have another stack of baked salmon with you.",r={"Baked Salmon (20)"}},
[8617]={o="Bring 50 singed corestones to General Zog in Durotar.",r={"Singed Corestone (50)"}},
[8620]={o="Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",r={"Draconic For Dummies: Volume II (1)"}},
[8621]={o="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. &nbsp;This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",r={"Qiraji Bindings of Dominance (1)","Idol of the Sage (2)","Bronze Scarab (5)","Clay Scarab (5)","Brood of Nozdormu: (1)"}},
