[8707]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Ornate Hilt, 2 &nbsp;Obsidian Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Ornate Hilt (1)","Obsidian Idol (2)","Silver Scarab (5)","Bone Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
