[8709]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 &nbsp;Vermillion Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Spiked Hilt (1)","Vermillion Idol (2)","Gold Scarab (5)","Clay Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8710]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Ornate Hilt, 2 &nbsp;Onyx Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Ornate Hilt (1)","Onyx Idol (2)","Gold Scarab (5)","Clay Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8711]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 &nbsp;Amber Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Spiked Hilt (1)","Amber Idol (2)","Bronze Scarab (5)","Ivory Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8712]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Azure Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r={"Qiraji Spiked Hilt (1)","Azure Idol (2)","Silver Scarab (5)","Bone Scarab (5)","Cenarion Circle: (1)"}},
[8728]={o="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to bring him 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 Elementium Ore, 10 Azerothian Diamonds, and 10 Blue Sapphires.",r={"Arcanite Bar (20)","Elementium Ore (10)","Azerothian Diamond (10)","Blue Sapphire (10)"}},
[8729]={o="Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara.",r={"Blue Scepter Shard (1)"}},
[8730]={o="Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task.",r={"Red Scepter Shard (1)","From the Desk of Lord Victor Nefarius (1)"}},
[8731]={o="Report to Krug Skullsplit at the Orgrimmar Legion post in front of Hive'Regal. &nbsp;Prepare your Unsigned Field Duty Papers, obtain Signed Field Duty Papers and bring them to Windcaller Kaldon in Cenarion Hold. Note: Healing or casting beneficial spells on a member of the Orgrimmar Legion will flag you for PvP.",r={"Signed Field Duty Papers (1)"}},
[8732]={o="Field duty papers? &nbsp;What manner of nonsense is this, &lt;name&gt;?",r={"Prepared Field Duty Papers (1)"}},
[8733]={o="Travel to the continent of Teldrassil and find Malfurion's agent somewhere outside the walls of Darnassus."},
[8734]={o="Travel to the Moonglade and speak to Keeper Remulos."},
[8735]={o="Travel to the four Emerald Dream portals in Azeroth and collect a Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption from each. Return to Keeper Remulos in the Moonglade when you have completed this task.",r={"Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption (1)","Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption (1)","Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption (1)","Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption (1)"}},
[8736]={o="Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",r={"The Redemption of Eranikus (1)"}},
[8737]={o="Summon and slay an Azure Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",r={"Azure Templar (1)"}},
[8738]={o="Contact Cenarion Scout Landion inside Hive'Regal and return the Hive'Regal Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Regal Scout Report (1)"}},
[8739]={o="Contact Cenarion Scout Jalia inside Hive'Ashi and return the Hive'Ashi Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Ashi Scout Report (1)"}},
[8740]={o="Slay Twilight Marauder Morna and 5 Twilight Marauders. &nbsp;Report to Windcaller Proudhorn when your task is finished. &nbsp;You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",r={"Twilight Marauder Morna (1)","Twilight Marauder (5)"}},
[8741]={o="Take the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris."},
[8742]={o="A thousand years has passed and just as it was fated, one stands before me. One who shall lead their people to a new age. The Old God trembles, &lt;name&gt;. Oh yes, it fears your faith. Shatter the prophecy of C'Thun. It knows you come, champion - and with you comes the might of Kalimdor. You have only to let me know when you are prepared and I shall grant you the Scepter of the Shifting Sands."},
[8743]={o="The Scarab Gong looms ominously before you. Steel yourself, &lt;name&gt;; for once the Scarab Gong is rung, the gates of Ahn'Qiraj will be opened. From the slackened maw of the beast can only come chaos and destruction. Defend your people!",r={"The Scepter of the Shifting Sands (1)"}},
[8745]={o="Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight. I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun."},
[8747]={o="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted. The signet ring of the defender will offer superior protection against the forces of evil. Be warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."},
[8748]={o="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8749]={o="You honor my kind, &lt;name&gt;. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight. You have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8750]={o="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, &lt;name&gt;. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world. Hand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8751]={o="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so! Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8752]={o="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted. The signet ring of the conqueror will greatly enhance your physical attacks. Be warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."},
[8753]={o="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8754]={o="You honor my kind, &lt;name&gt;. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight. You have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8755]={o="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, &lt;name&gt;. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world. Hand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8756]={o="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so! Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8757]={o="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted. The signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities. Be warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."},
[8758]={o="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8759]={o="You honor my kind, &lt;name&gt;. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight. You have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8760]={o="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, &lt;name&gt;. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world. Hand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8761]={o="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so! Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)"}},
[8764]={o="Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)","Stone Scarab (15)","Gold Scarab (15)","Silver Scarab (15)"}},
[8765]={o="Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)","Bronze Scarab (15)","Crystal Scarab (15)","Clay Scarab (15)"}},
[8766]={o="Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.",r={"Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)","Bone Scarab (15)","Ivory Scarab (15)","Stone Scarab (15)"}},
[8768]={o="This festively-wrapped present has your name on it. Wait, did it just move?",s="Gaily Wrapped Present",e="Gaily Wrapped Present"},
[8770]={o="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Defenders and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Ashi Defender (30)"}},
[8771]={o="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Sandstalkers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Ashi Sandstalker (30)"}},
[8772]={o="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Waywatchers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Zora Waywatcher (30)"}},
[8773]={o="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Reavers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Zora Reaver (30)"}},
[8774]={o="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Ambushers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Regal Ambusher (30)"}},
[8775]={o="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Spitfires and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Regal Spitfire (30)"}},
[8776]={o="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Slavemakers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Regal Slavemaker (30)"}},
[8777]={o="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Burrowers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Combat Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest.",r={"Hive'Regal Burrower (30)"}},
[8778]={o="Bring 6 Oils of Immolation, 5 Goblin Rocket Fuel and 10 Dense Blasting Powder to Arcanist Nozzlespring near Hive'Zora in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",r={"Oil of Immolation (6)","Goblin Rocket Fuel (5)","Dense Blasting Powder (10)"}},
[8779]={o="Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Large Radiant Shard and 1 Huge Emerald to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",r={"Large Brilliant Shard (1)","Large Radiant Shard (1)","Huge Emerald (1)"}},
[8780]={o="Bring 8 Rugged Armor Kits and 8 Heavy Armor Kits to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade Outpost near Hive'Zora in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Rugged Armor Kit (8)","Heavy Armor Kit (8)"}},
[8781]={o="Bring 2 Moonsteel Broadswords to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade Outpost outside of Hive'Zora. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",r={"Moonsteel Broadsword (2)"}},
[8782]={o="Bring 1 Mooncloth, 2 Bolts of Runecloth and 1 Ironweb Spider Silk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Mooncloth (1)","Bolt of Runecloth (2)","Ironweb Spider Silk (1)"}},
[8783]={o="Bring 2 Enchanted Thorium Bars and 2 Enchanted Leather to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",r={"Enchanted Thorium Bar (2)","Enchanted Leather (2)"}},
[8784]={o="Take the Ancient Qiraji Artifact to the dragons hiding near the entrance of the temple."},
[8785]={o="Bring 6 Powerful Mojo, 6 Flasks of Big Mojo and 8 Oils of Immolation to Shadow Priestess Shai near Hive'Regal in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",r={"Oil of Immolation (8)","Flask of Big Mojo (6)","Powerful Mojo (6)"}},
[8786]={o="Bring 3 Massive Iron Axes to Merok Longstride at the Orgrimmar Legion camp outside of Hive'Regal. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",r={"Massive Iron Axe (3)"}},
[8787]={o="Bring 8 Rugged Armor Kits and 8 Heavy Armor Kits to Merok Longstride near Hive'Regal. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Rugged Armor Kit (8)","Heavy Armor Kit (8)"}},
[8789]={o="Arygos in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj will create Elementium Infused Armaments for you should you bring him Imperial Qiraji Armaments and 3 Elementium Ore.",r={"Imperial Qiraji Armaments (1)","Elementium Ore (3)"}},
[8790]={o="Merithra of the Dream in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj will create Elementium Infused Armaments for you should you bring her Imperial Qiraji Regalia and 3 Elementium Ore.",r={"Imperial Qiraji Regalia (1)","Elementium Ore (3)"}},
[8791]={o="Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."},
[8792]={o="Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits."},
[8793]={o="Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits."},
[8794]={o="Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits."},
[8795]={o="Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."},
[8796]={o="Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."},
[8797]={o="Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."},
[8798]={o="Say! You know what?! You're an engineer too! So, since you helped me teach my friends a lesson, I'm going to teach you how to make your very own mechanical yeti! Now the fun can go on forever and ever, and you can scare whoever you want! Provided that you can scare up the components to make it that is. What do you say, &lt;name&gt;? Do you want to learn the secret to making a mechanical yeti?"},
[8800]={o="Talk to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."},
[8801]={o="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelastrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj."},
[8802]={o="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time."},
[8804]={o="Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",r={"Globe of Water (4)","Powerful Anti-Venom (4)","Smoked Desert Dumplings (4)"}},
[8805]={o="Bring 3 Ornate Mithril Boots to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",r={"Ornate Mithril Boots (3)"}},
[8806]={o="Bring 10 Dense Grinding Stones, 10 Solid Grinding Stones and 10 Heavy Grinding Stones to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",r={"Dense Grinding Stone (10)","Solid Grinding Stone (10)","Heavy Grinding Stone (10)"}},
[8807]={o="Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Large Radiant Shard and 1 Huge Emerald to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",r={"Large Brilliant Shard (1)","Large Radiant Shard (1)","Huge Emerald (1)"}},
[8808]={o="Bring 1 Mooncloth, 2 Bolts of Runecloth and 1 Ironweb Spider Silk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",r={"Mooncloth (1)","Bolt of Runecloth (2)","Ironweb Spider Silk (1)"}},
[8809]={o="Bring 2 Enchanted Thorium Bars and 2 Enchanted Leather to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",r={"Enchanted Thorium Bar (2)","Enchanted Leather (2)"}},
[8810]={o="Bring 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, 30 Heavy Silk Bandages and 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandages to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",r={"Heavy Runecloth Bandage (30)","Heavy Mageweave Bandage (30)","Heavy Silk Bandage (30)"}},
[8811]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Darnassus. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8812]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Gnomeregan Exiles. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8813]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Ironforge. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8814]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Stormwind. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8815]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Orgrimmar. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Horde Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8816]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Darkspear tribe. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Horde Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8817]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Undercity. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Horde Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8818]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Thunder Bluff. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Horde Commendation Signet (1)"}},
[8819]={o="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. &nbsp;For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Darnassus. &nbsp;I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. &nbsp;We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored. With that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (10)"}},
[8820]={o="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. &nbsp;For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with the Gnomeregan Exiles. &nbsp;I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. &nbsp;We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored. With that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (10)"}},
