[8829]={o="Bring a Skin of Shadow, 3 Frayed Abomination Stitchings and 1 Twilight Cultist Robe to Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. &nbsp;You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest.",r={"Skin of Shadow (1)","Frayed Abomination Stitching (3)","Twilight Cultist Robe (1)"}},
[8830]={o="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Darnassus. Please bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. &nbsp;We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten. With that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",r={"Alliance Commendation Signet (1)"}},
