[8893]={o="The Super Egg-O-Matic is the latest of Curgle Cranklehop's inventions. It is quite an impressive piece of machinery. The Super Egg-O-Matic sputters wildly as you approach the control panel.",r={"Hippogryph Egg (1)"}},
