[9265]={o="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside the Undercity and investigate the glowing runic circles nearby their encampment.",r={"Dim Necrotic Stone (3)","(1)","Investigate a circle (1)"}},
[9266]={o="You must've done something really bad to us or our friends, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;At any rate, I'm here to offer you a way to get our good graces back. As you know, Winterspring is quite cold. &nbsp;With so many of us goblins coming from other cities, we could use a hand keeping warm. &nbsp;Bring me some runecloth and coal and I'll put in the good word for ya. &nbsp;Be warned though, our enemies are not going to take kindly to your helping us.",r={"Runecloth (40)","Coal (4)"}},
[9267]={o="You'd better think twice before setting foot in Ratchet, &lt;name&gt;! &nbsp;Word's been getting around of your dirty deeds. You're in luck though, a ship just arrived with many wounded from an encounter with the Bloodsail Buccaneers. &nbsp;This is your chance to prove you're not a complete scoundrel. &nbsp;Lend us a hand by bringing linen cloth for bandages and empty vials for potions.",r={"Linen Cloth (40)","Empty Vial (4)"}},
[9268]={o="You seek to befriend the goblins of Tanaris once again, &lt;name&gt;? &nbsp;We're in need of materials for sails and guns to fight off our old enemies, the Bloodsail Buccaneers. &nbsp;Bring me mageweave and strong flux and we'll be on our way to pardoning your trespasses.",r={"Mageweave Cloth (40)","Strong Flux (4)"}},
[9269]={o="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",r={"Atiesh Cleansed (1)"}},
[9270]={o="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",r={"Atiesh Cleansed (1)"}},
[9271]={o="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",r={"Atiesh Cleansed (1)"}},
[9272]={o="Yarrr... if ye be keen on enjoying the company of us experienced sea dogs, you'd best belay dressing like a blaggard! &nbsp;Here, put on something proper 'fore I keelhaul yer hide. These'll fit ye better than they ever fit that old dog, Red-Eyed Ben. &nbsp;Lost him in a devil of a storm at sea. Wear 'em with pride, mate!"},
